    <node id="TRACE CHEMICAL ADDITIVES">
      <data key="d0">CHEMICAL</data>
      <data key="d1">Trace chemical additives, such as vesicants and flame retardants, are present in polyether-PU foam and may influence the gut microbial community of mealworms.</data>
