    <node id="POLY(BISPHENOL-A CARBONATE)">
      <data key="d0">ENVIRONMENTAL POLLUTANT</data>
      <data key="d1">Poly(bisphenol-A carbonate) is a plastic material that can be chemically recycled in an environmentally friendly manner.&lt;SEP&gt;Poly(bisphenol-A carbonate) is a type of plastic that can be chemically recycled through environmentally friendly methods such as alkaline hydrolysis under microwave irradiation.</data>
