      <data key="d0">MICROPLASTIC</data>
      <data key="d1">Polystyrene micro- and nanoplastics are small plastic particles derived from polystyrene, which interact with soil protists and other organisms in the environment.&lt;SEP&gt;Polystyrene micro- and nanoplastics are small plastic particles derived from polystyrene, which interact with soil protists and other organisms in the environment.&lt;SEP&gt;Polystyrene micro- and nanoplastics are small plastic particles that interact with soil protists, affecting their environmental behavior.</data>
