      <data key="d1">A laser particle analyzer is used to measure the size distribution of residual plastic particles recovered from frass samples.&lt;SEP&gt;Residual plastic particles are undigested microplastics that remain in mealworm intestines after biodegradation, with PVC particles being more persistent than PE and PS.</data>
