    <node id="ILLUMINA MISEQ">
      <data key="d0">RESEARCH STUDY</data>
      <data key="d1">Illumina MiSeq is a sequencing platform used for robust environmental microbial community analysis, enabling high-throughput sequencing of microbial DNA.&lt;SEP&gt;Illumina MiSeq is a sequencing platform used to analyze DNA, including metagenomic data from mealworm larvae gut microbiota.&lt;SEP&gt;Illumina MiSeq is a sequencing platform used to analyze the bacterial and fungal microbiome diversities in the guts of superworms and mealworms.&lt;SEP&gt;Illumina MiSeq is a sequencing technology used to analyze the gut bacterial microbiome of superworms and yellow mealworms, revealing changes in bacterial communities due to plastic diets.&lt;SEP&gt;Illumina MiSeq is a sequencing technology used to analyze the gut bacterial- and fungal-microbiomes of insect larvae during plastic biodegradation studies.&lt;SEP&gt;The Illumina MiSeq is a sequencing platform used for 16S rRNA amplicon sequencing to analyze microbial communities in Tenebrio molitor larvae.&lt;SEP&gt;The Illumina MiSeq is a sequencing platform used for amplicon sequencing of gut microbial DNA from mealworms.&lt;SEP&gt;The Illumina MiSeq platform was used for sequencing the gut microbiome of larvae to analyze microbial diversity and its role in plastic biodegradation.&lt;SEP&gt;Illumina MiSeq is a sequencing technology used to analyze the changes in gut bacterial and fungal microbiomes of yellow mealworms fed with surgical mask layers.&lt;SEP&gt;Illumina MiSeq is a sequencing technology used to analyze the gut bacterial community of yellow mealworms and its response to different mask layer diets.&lt;SEP&gt;Illumina MiSeq is used to analyze the 16S rRNA and ITS genes to study changes in gut bacterial and fungal diversities in yellow mealworms fed with surgical masks.&lt;SEP&gt;Illumina MiSeq is a sequencing platform used to analyze DNA, including metagenomic data from mealworm larvae gut microbiota.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-a4c43611ebe237c15c5f9201a9f8dbee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ec1a5b2913dd6782ff1e0533dd57325f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e127a4930b6154498b93c2e94f2b7c20&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1f0f043d44950fae05e8207a298d4a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-512840a413df7ae3d881389c5cf1feb3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f79f3fee16e3f983c9f04a66e4d50760&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9e663286500e382f6d296e2b683bf542&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2417ca11674320d88eecdf4cb66f9d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a38c714e7f1f701ec1149e25910e16e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f8516b10110f884279870c2ef887f64&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-41af774fc28352c7dd95d8c3cb43f855</data>
