    <node id="MG-RAST">
      <data key="d0">RESEARCH STUDY</data>
      <data key="d1">MG-RAST is a server used for metagenomic data analysis, including quality control and taxonomic classification of microbial communities.&lt;SEP&gt;MG-RAST is a server used for metagenomic data analysis, including quality control and taxonomic classification of microbial communities.&lt;SEP&gt;MetaGenome Rapid Annotation Subsystems Technology (MG-RAST) is a server used for analyzing sequencing results from microbial communities in Tenebrio molitor larvae.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-512840a413df7ae3d881389c5cf1feb3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f8516b10110f884279870c2ef887f64</data>
    </node>
    <node id="STAMP">
      <data key="d0">RESEARCH STUDY</data>
      <data key="d1">STAMP (Statistical Analysis of Metagenomic Profiles) is a tool used to identify statistically significant differences between metagenomes.&lt;SEP&gt;STAMP (Statistical Analysis of Metagenomic Profiles) is a tool used to identify statistically significant differences between metagenomes.&lt;SEP&gt;Statistical Analysis of Metagenomic Profiles (STAMP) is used to analyze taxonomic differences between metagenomes in Tenebrio molitor larvae research.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-512840a413df7ae3d881389c5cf1feb3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f8516b10110f884279870c2ef887f64</data>
