    </node>
    <node id="METAGENOMICS RAST SERVER">
      <data key="d0">RESEARCH STUDY</data>
      <data key="d1">The Metagenomics RAST server is a public resource for the automatic phylogenetic and functional analysis of metagenomes.&lt;SEP&gt;The Metagenomics RAST server is a tool for the automatic phylogenetic and functional analysis of metagenomic data.</data>
