    </node>
    <node id="DRY-WOOD TERMITES">
      <data key="d0">ORGANISM</data>
      <data key="d1">Dry-wood termites are insects that host Bacteroidales ectosymbionts, which shape the nitrogen-fixing community in their gut.&lt;SEP&gt;Dry-wood termites are insects that host Bacteroidales ectosymbionts, which shape the nitrogen-fixing community in their guts.</data>
