    <node id="GUT FLAGELLATES">
      <data key="d0">ORGANISM</data>
      <data key="d1">Gut flagellates are microorganisms found in the digestive systems of termites, hosting ectosymbionts that aid in nitrogen fixation.&lt;SEP&gt;Gut flagellates are protozoa found in the digestive tracts of termites, hosting ectosymbiotic bacteria that aid in nitrogen fixation.</data>
