    <node id="PLASTIC RECYCLING">
      <data key="d0">RESEARCH STUDY</data>
      <data key="d1">Plastic recycling refers to the process of recovering scrap or waste plastic and reprocessing it into useful products, addressing environmental pollution caused by plastic waste.&lt;SEP&gt;Plastic recycling research explores methods to reuse and recover plastic waste, reducing its environmental impact.</data>
