    <node id="PLASTICS EUROPE">
      <data key="d0">RESEARCH STUDY</data>
      <data key="d1">Plastics Europe is an association of plastics manufacturers that provides data and research on plastic production, usage, and environmental impact.&lt;SEP&gt;Plastics Europe is an association that provides data and analysis on European plastics production, demand, and waste.&lt;SEP&gt;Plastics Europe is an organization that provides data and insights on the production, use, and recycling of plastics, including the "Plastics - the Facts 2022" report.&lt;SEP&gt;Plastics Europe is an organization that provides data and insights on the production, use, and recycling of plastics, including the "Plastics - the Facts 2022" report.&lt;SEP&gt;Plastics Europe is an organization that provides data and insights on plastic production, usage, and environmental impact.</data>
