    <node id="WOOD-FEEDING BEETLE">
      <data key="d0">ORGANISM</data>
      <data key="d1">The wood-feeding beetle hosts a microbial community that aids in the degradation of lignocellulose, a complex plant material.&lt;SEP&gt;The wood-feeding beetle is an insect whose gut anatomical properties and microbial functional assembly promote lignocellulose deconstruction, aiding in colony subsistence.</data>
