    </node>
    <node id="ISATTCHENKIA">
      <data key="d0">ORGANISM</data>
      <data key="d1">Issatchenkia is a genus of fungi found in the gut microbiome of insect larvae, associated with the degradation of both polyethylene (PE) and polystyrene (PS) plastics.</data>
