      <data key="d1">Dysgonomonas is a genus of bacteria associated with the degradation of polystyrene (PS) in the guts of superworms.&lt;SEP&gt;Dysgonomonas is a genus of bacteria found in the gut microbiome of insect larvae, associated with the degradation of polystyrene (PS) plastics.&lt;SEP&gt;Dysgonomonas is a genus of bacteria linked to PET degradation in the gut microbiota of Tenebrio molitor.</data>
