    <node id="PLASTIC-FED GROUPS">
      <data key="d0">RESEARCH STUDY</data>
      <data key="d1">Plastic-fed groups are experimental groups in the study, used to analyze the gut microbiome composition and plastic degradation capabilities of mealworms and superworms.&lt;SEP&gt;Plastic-fed groups refer to the experimental groups in which superworms and yellow mealworms were fed polystyrene (PS) and polyethylene (PE) as their sole diet, leading to changes in their gut microbiome composition.</data>
