    </node>
    <node id="ENVIRONMENTAL IMPACT ASSESSMENT">
      <data key="d0">ENVIRONMENTAL POLLUTANT</data>
      <data key="d1">Environmental impact assessment involves evaluating the effects of human activities, such as plastic production, on the environment.&lt;SEP&gt;Environmental impact assessment refers to the evaluation of the potential effects of substances or activities on the environment.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-2c3165b5b483903ac54f813f43b4076d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6464a2f3ca18442f70e254b9341a3e1c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="LIFE CYCLE ASSESSMENT">
      <data key="d0">RESEARCH STUDY</data>
      <data key="d1">Life cycle assessment (LCA) is a method used to evaluate the environmental impacts of plastic biodegradation processes within a waste management system.&lt;SEP&gt;Life cycle assessment (LCA) is a methodology used to evaluate the environmental impacts of products or processes, such as the production of biofuels or mealworms as a protein source.&lt;SEP&gt;Life cycle assessment is a method used to evaluate the environmental impacts of a product or process throughout its entire life cycle, from production to disposal.&lt;SEP&gt;Life cycle assessment is a methodology used to evaluate the environmental impacts of products, including plastics, throughout their life cycle.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-33180d5b7e1ebfedf8de59ba1a2a2d04&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b08485bef3ee3db21e59e159ad4c3e20&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-463ac9dfa68274d35700c61208f4ea85&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6464a2f3ca18442f70e254b9341a3e1c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="EDIBLE INSECTS">
      <data key="d0">ALTERNATIVE PROTEIN SOURCE</data>
      <data key="d1">Edible insects are being explored as a sustainable and alternative protein source for animal and human diets.&lt;SEP&gt;Edible insects are being explored as an alternative source of protein for animal diets due to their nutritional value and sustainability.&lt;SEP&gt;Edible insects, such as Tenebrio molitor, are considered alternative protein sources for animal diets due to their high protein content and sustainability.&lt;SEP&gt;Edible insects, such as Tenebrio molitor, are recognized as a sustainable and protein-rich alternative food source for both humans and livestock.&lt;SEP&gt;Edible insects, such as mealworms, are being explored as sustainable and nutritious alternative protein sources for human and animal consumption.&lt;SEP&gt;Edible insects, such as Tenebrio molitor, are recognized as a sustainable and protein-rich food source with low ecological risk.&lt;SEP&gt;Edible insects, such as Tenebrio molitor, are being studied for their nutritional value and potential as a sustainable protein source.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-3351564dbd6a0ee6a8b97f6687378ffc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-00a6288e1109e01eac1ce7ecb35f2eda&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-19868f1234aac10de61c710c8352c076&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-697bf99ecf19f99243f3b5a4ef5b334c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-df24ea37743c236d369911024fc20bfc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6464a2f3ca18442f70e254b9341a3e1c</data>
    </node>
