    <node id="UNFED LARVAE">
      <data key="d0">ORGANISM</data>
      <data key="d1">Unfed larvae are Tenebrio molitor larvae that are not provided with any food, serving as a control group to compare weight loss and survival rates.&lt;SEP&gt;Unfed larvae are Tenebrio molitor larvae that were not fed, used as a control group in the study of PET biodegradation.</data>
