      <data key="d1">PET-agar gel is a mixture of PET microplastics and agar used as a feeding substrate for Tenebrio molitor larvae in biodegradation studies.&lt;SEP&gt;PET-agar gel is a mixture of polyethylene terephthalate (PET) and agar used as a diet for mealworms in biodegradation studies.&lt;SEP&gt;PET-agar gel is a mixture of polyethylene terephthalate (PET) and agar used as a diet for mealworms in biodegradation studies.</data>
