    <node id="Α-GLUCOSIDASE">
      <data key="d0">CHEMICAL</data>
      <data key="d1">α-Glucosidase is an enzyme identified in the gut microbiome of mealworms, playing a role in the biodegradation of plastics.&lt;SEP&gt;α-glucosidase is an enzyme in the gut microbiome of mealworms that acts during the biodegradation of plastics.</data>
