    <node id="STYRENE-DEGRADING MICROORGANISMS">
      <data key="d0">ORGANISM</data>
      <data key="d1">Styrene-degrading microorganisms include various classes of bacteria and fungi capable of degrading polystyrene (PS), as reported in the literature.</data>
