      <data key="d0">ORGANISM</data>
      <data key="d1">Brachystola magna, also known as the plains lubber grasshopper, is an insect used in the production of chitosan.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-2c3165b5b483903ac54f813f43b4076d</data>
    </node>
