      <data key="d0">ORGANISM</data>
      <data key="d1">BALB/c mice are a strain of laboratory mice used in studies to evaluate the effects of mealworm exuviae on gut microbiota.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-2c3165b5b483903ac54f813f43b4076d</data>
    </node>
