      <data key="d0">ENVIRONMENTAL POLLUTANT</data>
      <data key="d1">Wastewater treatment plants are facilities that treat sewage and often contain microplastics and other pollutants.&lt;SEP&gt;Wastewater treatment plants are facilities where microplastics are detected and removed, highlighting their role in environmental pollution management.&lt;SEP&gt;Wastewater treatment plants are facilities where microplastics can be converted or removed, addressing environmental pollution.</data>
