      <data key="d0">BIODEGRADATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Gut microbiome changes refer to alterations in the microbial community of the digestive tract, often influenced by diet or environmental factors.&lt;SEP&gt;Gut microbiome changes refer to the alterations in the microbial communities of yellow mealworms and superworms during the biodegradation of plastics, which influence their degradation capacities.</data>
