      <data key="d0">TOXICOLOGICAL ASSESSMENT</data>
      <data key="d1">Ecotoxicological effects refer to the harmful impacts of substances like microplastics on ecosystems and organisms within them.&lt;SEP&gt;Ecotoxicological effects refer to the impact of substances, such as plastics and microplastics, on ecosystems and organisms.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-2c3165b5b483903ac54f813f43b4076d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3569d74f8a4c9d0851777a5a66284a00</data>
