    <node id="PLASTIC-DEGRADING ENZYMES">
      <data key="d0">CHEMICAL</data>
      <data key="d1">Plastic-degrading enzymes are proteins produced by gut microbiota that facilitate the breakdown of polystyrene and other plastics.&lt;SEP&gt;Plastic-degrading enzymes are proteins produced by microorganisms that can break down plastics, contributing to biodegradation.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-2c3165b5b483903ac54f813f43b4076d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4304c39ef3427872131caf77e7cdb438</data>
