      <data key="d1">A chemical compound identified in the gut intestine content of Tenebrio molitor larvae during polystyrene biodegradation.&lt;SEP&gt;Hexadecanoic acid, 2-hydroxy-1-(hydroxymethyl)ethyl ester is a fatty acid ester excreted by mealworms during the metabolism of PS-containing diets.</data>
