    </node>
    <node id="HEXADECANE, 2-METHYL-">
      <data key="d0">CHEMICAL</data>
      <data key="d1">Hexadecane, 2-methyl- is a hydrocarbon excreted by mealworms during the metabolism of PS-containing diets.</data>
