      <data key="d1">Acetoin is a chemical compound whose production potential in larvae varies depending on the diet and plastic exposure.&lt;SEP&gt;Acetoin is a metabolic byproduct found in the gut microbiome of mealworms, particularly associated with cellulose-based diets.</data>
