      <data key="d0">CHEMICAL</data>
      <data key="d1">Tryptophan deaminase is an enzyme found in the gut microbiome of mealworms, particularly associated with plastic-based diets.&lt;SEP&gt;Tryptophan deaminase is an enzyme whose activity in larvae varies depending on the diet and plastic exposure.</data>
