      <data key="d0">CHEMICAL</data>
      <data key="d1">Amygdalin is a chemical compound whose utilization by larvae varies depending on the diet and plastic exposure.&lt;SEP&gt;Amygdalin is a compound that was taken up by the gut microbiota of mealworms in the PE and PS diet groups, indicating a unique metabolic capacity.</data>
