      <data key="d1">Lignocellulosic crop wastes are agricultural byproducts that can be reduced by mealworms, contributing to sustainable waste management.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-8d1301f6942d17092ef7b22ac40f19f5</data>
    </node>
    <node id="MEALWORM FRASS AS FERTILIZER">
      <data key="d0">CHEMICAL</data>
      <data key="d1">Mealworm frass, the excrement of mealworms, is studied for its potential use as a fertilizer after biodegrading polystyrene.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-8d1301f6942d17092ef7b22ac40f19f5</data>
    </node>
