    <node id="FOOD CHEMISTRY">
      <data key="d0">FOOD SAFETY</data>
      <data key="d1">Food Chemistry is a journal that published a study on the impact of polystyrene consumption by edible insects Tenebrio molitor and Zophobas morio on their nutritional value, cytotoxicity, and oxidative stress parameters.&lt;SEP&gt;Food chemistry studies the impact of polystyrene consumption by edible insects like Tenebrio molitor and Zophobas morio on their nutritional value and safety.</data>
