      <data key="d1">Cucumber is a nutrient source used in experiments to study its effect on EPS consumption by mealworms.&lt;SEP&gt;Cucumber is a nutrient source used in experiments to study its effect on EPS consumption by mealworms.&lt;SEP&gt;Cucumber is used as a supplemental nutrient in habitats to study its effect on mealworm behavior and EPS consumption.&lt;SEP&gt;Cucumber is used as a supplemental nutrient in habitats to study its effect on mealworm behavior and EPS consumption.</data>
