      <data key="d0">BIODEGRADATION</data>
      <data key="d1">Enterobacter hormaechei is studied for its ability to biodegrade polystyrene microplastics under anaerobic conditions, offering insights into plastic waste management.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-a3934e2c5488a209e54e10ba4c0335a6</data>
