    </node>
    <node id="MARINE LITTER CRISIS MANAGEMENT STRATEGIES">
      <data key="d0">RESEARCH STUDY</data>
      <data key="d1">The development of strategies for managing the marine litter crisis, particularly plastics, is a critical area of research.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-a3934e2c5488a209e54e10ba4c0335a6</data>
    </node>
