    <node id="BIT-26T">
      <data key="d0">ORGANISM</data>
      <data key="d1">BIT-26T is a novel bacterial strain in the genus Mixta, characterized by its genome size, G+C content, and physiological properties.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-576a8e18f3d6ea8c7d4a5f2cd554423c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="GENOME ANALYSIS">
      <data key="d0">RESEARCH STUDY</data>
      <data key="d1">Genome analysis of BIT-26T was conducted to determine its genetic characteristics, including genome size, G+C content, and gene predictions.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-576a8e18f3d6ea8c7d4a5f2cd554423c</data>
    </node>
    <node id="PHYSIOLOGICAL PROPERTIES">
      <data key="d0">RESEARCH STUDY</data>
      <data key="d1">The physiological properties of BIT-26T, including growth conditions, motility, and cell morphology, were investigated in the study.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-576a8e18f3d6ea8c7d4a5f2cd554423c</data>
    </node>
