      <data key="d2">chunk-9d01d291012bd548fc067e250ec39fba</data>
    </node>
    <node id="NOVEL FOODS">
      <data key="d0">FOOD SAFETY</data>
      <data key="d1">Novel foods, such as Tenebrio molitor larvae, are authorized for consumption under EU regulations, ensuring food safety.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-9d01d291012bd548fc067e250ec39fba</data>
    </node>
    <node id="WARE POTATOES">
      <data key="d0">CHEMICAL</data>
      <data key="d1">Ware potatoes are a feed used in experiments, showing the lowest mortality rates in mealworms compared to other feeds.&lt;SEP&gt;Ware potatoes are a feed used in the study to evaluate their influence on the nutritional content of Tenebrio molitor larvae.&lt;SEP&gt;Ware potatoes are used as a feed component for Tenebrio molitor larvae, affecting their development and nutritional content.</data>
