      <data key="d0">CHEMICAL</data>
      <data key="d1">Monoenoic fatty acids are a group of fatty acids found in mealworm larvae, with their content varying depending on the feed type.&lt;SEP&gt;Monoenoic fatty acids are a type of fatty acid found in mealworms, with their levels varying based on the feed type.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-a660790845c6a68ed38b428a7756fc84&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ba22196a59b67cbf67af7d76a039af1e</data>
