    </node>
    <node id="POTASSIUM PHOSPHATE (KH2PO4)">
      <data key="d0">CHEMICAL</data>
      <data key="d1">Potassium phosphate (KH2PO4) is a salt used in the preparation of mineral medium, providing essential nutrients for microbial growth.</data>
      <data key="d2">chunk-a32ea55d79e87933e26b4165db47b1fc</data>
