      <data key="d3">17.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Yellow mealworms are tested for their ability to degrade polyether-PU foam, contributing to environmental pollution reduction.&lt;SEP&gt;Yellow mealworms can chew and ingest polyether-PU foam, leading to significant mass loss and biodegradation</data>
