    </edge>
    <edge source="YELLOW MEALWORMS" target="GUT MICROBIOME">
      <data key="d3">106.0</data>
      <data key="d4">The gut microbiome of yellow mealworms changes significantly when fed polyether-PU foam, indicating its role in biodegradation&lt;SEP&gt;The gut microbiome of yellow mealworms is essential for the biodegradation of PVC, with specific microorganisms and gene modules playing a key role.&lt;SEP&gt;The gut microbiome of yellow mealworms is essential for the biodegradation of plastics, with microbial communities shifting in response to plastic consumption.&lt;SEP&gt;The gut microbiome of yellow mealworms plays a key role in the biodegradation of plastics, with shifts in microbial populations observed during the process.&lt;SEP&gt;The gut microbiome of yellow mealworms plays a significant role in the biodegradation of plastics such as PS and PU.&lt;SEP&gt;The gut microbiome of yellow mealworms plays a crucial role in the biodegradation of plastics.&lt;SEP&gt;The gut microbiome of yellow mealworms is essential for the biodegradation of polypropylene plastics, as shown by changes in microbial diversity.&lt;SEP&gt;The gut microbiome of yellow mealworms plays a crucial role in the biodegradation of polypropylene materials, such as surgical masks.&lt;SEP&gt;The gut microbiome of yellow mealworms is analyzed to understand its role in the potential biodegradation of plastic materials.</data>
      <data key="d5">8&lt;SEP&gt;9</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-cfbd751517e11b1b4052961a01008cbc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0014171c7ef07a60c6be3b57e791688c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-444b8acd02a76616457012e1ac0db23b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-530244abdca5889849fcf86f017ebd77&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2417ca11674320d88eecdf4cb66f9d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dad389953d78e790a40a9267c5b591c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e16c2c8ec44f02a1180cfb4b9e4fb90f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f79f3fee16e3f983c9f04a66e4d50760&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-323c02b97d9365a25761a155d358b17a</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="YELLOW MEALWORMS" target="BRAN">
      <data key="d3">38.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Bran is supplemented to mealworms to facilitate plastic consumption and support larval growth.&lt;SEP&gt;Bran is used as a control diet for yellow mealworms in studies comparing the effects of polyether-PU foam&lt;SEP&gt;Yellow mealworms fed with bran show higher survival and pupation rates compared to those fed with PS or PU, indicating the importance of nutrients in their development.&lt;SEP&gt;Bran is used as a control diet for yellow mealworms to compare the effects of surgical mask layers on their survival, growth, and gut microbiome.&lt;SEP&gt;Bran is used as a control diet to compare the effects of plastic diets on the growth and survival of yellow mealworms.</data>
      <data key="d5">7&lt;SEP&gt;8</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-444b8acd02a76616457012e1ac0db23b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c16dd402d0a926c1a975280e2b32e84e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e16c2c8ec44f02a1180cfb4b9e4fb90f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f79f3fee16e3f983c9f04a66e4d50760&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-323c02b97d9365a25761a155d358b17a</data>
    </edge>
