      <data key="d4">Frass from yellow mealworms contains fragments of polyether-PU foam, indicating incomplete biodegradation&lt;SEP&gt;Yellow mealworms produce frass containing partially degraded mask materials and new organic substances, reflecting their role in biodegradation.</data>
