      <data key="d4">High-throughput sequencing is used to analyze shifts in the gut microbiome of yellow mealworms during plastic degradation, providing insights into microbial changes.&lt;SEP&gt;High-throughput sequencing is used to study changes in the gut microbiome of yellow mealworms fed polyether-PU foam</data>
      <data key="d5">7&lt;SEP&gt;8</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-e16c2c8ec44f02a1180cfb4b9e4fb90f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dad389953d78e790a40a9267c5b591c7</data>
