      <data key="d4">The consumption of polyether-PU by yellow mealworms leads to depolymerization, altering the chemical structure of the foam&lt;SEP&gt;Yellow mealworms contribute to the depolymerization of surgical masks, breaking down the polymers into smaller units.</data>
