      <data key="d3">14.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Wheat bran is used as a control diet to compare the effects of a natural diet versus a mask-based diet on yellow mealworms.&lt;SEP&gt;Wheat bran is used as a control feed to compare the effects of plastic consumption on yellow mealworms' growth and nutritional value.</data>
