    </edge>
    <edge source="YELLOW MEALWORMS" target="OXIDATIVE STRESS">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Consumption of plastics like PVC can induce oxidative stress in yellow mealworms, affecting their health and survival.</data>
