      <data key="d3">15.0</data>
      <data key="d4">The life cycle of yellow mealworms is studied to understand their development and health, particularly in relation to plastic consumption.&lt;SEP&gt;Yellow mealworms can complete their life cycle even when fed polystyrene, demonstrating their resilience and potential for plastic waste management.</data>
