      <data key="d3">17.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Yellow mealworms can ingest and degrade disposable surgical masks, with significant changes in their gut microbial community.&lt;SEP&gt;Yellow mealworms were fed different layers of disposable surgical masks to study their ability to degrade polypropylene materials.</data>
