      <data key="d3">16.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Yellow mealworms are capable of biodegrading surgical masks, with different layers of the masks showing varying degradation patterns.&lt;SEP&gt;Yellow mealworms ingest and degrade different layers of surgical masks, with a preference for the middle layer.</data>
