    <edge source="YELLOW MEALWORMS" target="PP FOAM PLASTICS">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Yellow mealworms were previously studied for their ability to degrade PP foam plastics, showing increased consumption when co-fed with bran.</data>
