    <edge source="YELLOW MEALWORMS" target="PP">
      <data key="d3">15.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Yellow mealworms can degrade PP through the action of gut bacteria like Lactococcus.&lt;SEP&gt;Yellow mealworms consume PP, leading to changes in their gut bacterial communities and potential degradation of the plastic.</data>
