      <data key="d3">15.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Yellow mealworms can ingest and biodegrade polypropylene (PP), with specific gut fungi like Rhodotorula and Cryptococcus playing a key role in the process.&lt;SEP&gt;Yellow mealworms were fed PP as a sole diet, showing limited weight gain and survival rates, indicating partial consumption and potential biodegradation.</data>
      <data key="d5">7&lt;SEP&gt;8</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-444b8acd02a76616457012e1ac0db23b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3e34d58a20a707b35e8fcd5658ba2924</data>
