      <data key="d3">15.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Yellow mealworms biodegrade polyurethane (PU), with higher fungal community richness and extracellular enzyme production observed in PU-fed groups.&lt;SEP&gt;Yellow mealworms consumed PU as a sole diet, with intermediate survival rates and weight changes, suggesting partial biodegradation.</data>
      <data key="d5">7&lt;SEP&gt;8</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-444b8acd02a76616457012e1ac0db23b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3e34d58a20a707b35e8fcd5658ba2924</data>
