      <data key="d3">15.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Yellow mealworms can biodegrade ethylene-vinyl acetate (EVA), though it has adverse effects on larval weight and survival due to its complex structure.&lt;SEP&gt;Yellow mealworms fed EVA showed the lowest survival rates, indicating potential toxicity and adverse effects of the plastic material.</data>
      <data key="d5">7&lt;SEP&gt;8</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-444b8acd02a76616457012e1ac0db23b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3e34d58a20a707b35e8fcd5658ba2924</data>
    </edge>
