      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">The starvation group is used to study the effects of food deprivation on yellow mealworms, showing lower survival rates compared to plastic-fed groups.</data>
      <data key="d5">7</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-444b8acd02a76616457012e1ac0db23b</data>
    </edge>
