    <edge source="GUT MICROBIOME" target="ZOPHOBAS ATRATUS">
      <data key="d3">51.0</data>
      <data key="d4">The gut microbiome of Zophobas atratus is essential for the biodegradation of plastics, including polypropylene (PP)&lt;SEP&gt;The gut microbiome of superworms is essential for the biodegradation of plastics like low-density polyethylene and polystyrene.&lt;SEP&gt;The gut microbiome of Zophobas atratus undergoes distinct changes during the biodegradation of plastics, affecting the process.&lt;SEP&gt;The gut microbiome of superworms plays a role in the oxidative degradation of polyethylene.&lt;SEP&gt;The gut microbiome of Zophobas atratus larvae is essential for the biodegradation of polypropylene.&lt;SEP&gt;The gut microbiome of Zophobas atratus plays a crucial role in the biodegradation of plastics, such as polystyrene and polyethylene.</data>
      <data key="d5">7&lt;SEP&gt;8&lt;SEP&gt;9</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-4c0c246e98a503a16ace92f28394b584&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce7cf71b094ef4329d3da3b628438bec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf54b3c2c01c935a178261a31b8ed897&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-31b2c5f608adabba1cc6986356e96598&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f5613b129e38cb777855c04f228fe7e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-08257b9745bccf6dfc5ca860da5a96bd</data>
