    <edge source="GUT MICROBIOME" target="NEXT-GENERATION SEQUENCING">
      <data key="d3">24.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Next-generation sequencing is used to explore the gut microbiome of mealworms and its role in PS biodegradation.&lt;SEP&gt;Next-generation sequencing was used to analyze the gut microbiome of mealworms and its changes under different plastic diets.&lt;SEP&gt;Next-generation sequencing is used to identify bacterial groups in the gut microbiome of Tenebrio molitor larvae that participate in waste degradation.</data>
      <data key="d5">8</data>
