    <edge source="GUT MICROBIOME" target="GALLERIA MELLONELLA">
      <data key="d3">43.0</data>
      <data key="d4">The gut microbiome of Galleria mellonella facilitates the biodegradation of polyethylene and polystyrene.&lt;SEP&gt;The gut microbiome of Galleria mellonella plays a crucial role in the biodegradation of polyethylene and polystyrene.&lt;SEP&gt;The gut microbiome of Galleria mellonella plays a crucial role in the biodegradation of LDPE&lt;SEP&gt;The gut microbiome of Galleria mellonella larvae is essential for the biodegradation of plastics, such as polyethylene and polystyrene.&lt;SEP&gt;The gut microbiome of Galleria mellonella larvae is involved in the biodegradation of polystyrene microplastics.</data>
      <data key="d5">8&lt;SEP&gt;9</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-681ece0a8beca8b22f3c6aa11a564f63&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-032b3b0fe0366e6e76e86abf8c48d200&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-79e833cbc3a0a6e2c80e1b69da50317e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db579d338d8f90574e3ac67a3ae9938d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bfd8d6b8105d9868a4ffadf5779d0df5</data>
    </edge>
