      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">The gut microbiome of wax moth larvae (Galleria mellonella) facilitates the biodegradation of polyethylene and polystyrene.</data>
      <data key="d5">8</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-bfd8d6b8105d9868a4ffadf5779d0df5</data>
