      <data key="d3">6.0</data>
      <data key="d4">The gut microbiome of Tenebrio molitor larvae has a limited role in the depolymerization of low-density polyethylene compared to polystyrene.</data>
      <data key="d5">6</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-eb14281b4a095b6c531146d40b5110a1</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="GUT MICROBIOME" target="SHANNON INDEX">
      <data key="d3">15.0</data>
      <data key="d4">The Shannon index is used to measure the diversity of the gut microbiome in Tenebrio molitor larvae under different diets.&lt;SEP&gt;The Shannon index measures the diversity of the gut microbiome in mealworms, indicating the impact of different feeding conditions on microbial communities.</data>
      <data key="d5">7&lt;SEP&gt;8</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-c29fa50fac7d523f43c540627750c823&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb14281b4a095b6c531146d40b5110a1</data>
    </edge>
