    <edge source="BIODEGRADATION" target="MEALWORM GUT BACTERIA">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Mealworm gut bacteria play a key role in the biodegradation of plastics such as LDPE, HDPE, and PS.</data>
      <data key="d5">9</data>
