      <data key="d3">19.0</data>
      <data key="d4">PM S1 bacteria play a key role in the biodegradation of plastics like PE, HDPE, and PS.&lt;SEP&gt;PM S1 is involved in the biodegradation of LDPE, HDPE, and PS, as evidenced by weight loss, CO2 evolution, and structural changes.</data>
