    <edge source="BIODEGRADATION" target="RESEARCH STUDY">
      <data key="d3">433.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Research studies focus on understanding and improving the biodegradation of plastics by microorganisms and insects.&lt;SEP&gt;Research studies have been conducted to explore the biodegradation of synthetic plastics by various organisms and microorganisms.&lt;SEP&gt;Research studies investigate the biodegradation of plastics, such as polystyrene and polyethylene, by various organisms and bacteria.&lt;SEP&gt;The research study on biodegradation investigates the breakdown of plastics by various organisms and their gut microbiomes, with a particular focus on addressing the growing issue of plastic pollution. Key organisms studied include Tenebrio molitor (mealworms), Zophobas atratus (superworms), Galleria mellonella (waxworms), and Alphitobius diaperinus, as well as marine fungi. These organisms have demonstrated significant capabilities in biodegrading plastics such as polystyrene, polyethylene, polypropylene, and PVC. For instance, Tenebrio molitor and Zophobas atratus are particularly effective in degrading polystyrene and polyethylene, while Galleria mellonella shows potential in breaking down polystyrene and PVC.

The research highlights the critical role of gut microbiota and microbial and enzymatic processes in facilitating plastic degradation. Studies delve into the oxidative processes and gut microbiome interactions that enable these organisms to metabolize plastics, providing valuable insights into the metabolic pathways involved. By analyzing changes in molecular weight and polymer structure, researchers aim to enhance the natural biodegradation capabilities of these organisms and improve microbial and enzymatic processes.

Overall, the research underscores the importance of understanding and advancing biodegradation mechanisms to mitigate environmental pollution caused by plastics. By leveraging the natural abilities of insects and their gut microbiomes, these studies aim to develop innovative environmental solutions for plastic waste management and contribute to global efforts in reducing plastic pollution.&lt;SEP&gt;The research study focuses on the biodegradation of plastics by mealworms, highlighting the chemical and microbial processes involved.&lt;SEP&gt;The research study investigates the biodegradation of plastics, including PVC, PP, and PET, by organisms like T. obscurus.</data>
      <data key="d5">8&lt;SEP&gt;9</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-82390f5824b5ef543e1f258b1a47e167&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6f830cfd93570c7a9762518aa356ab69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56af57b5211422531c03b0cbcfded1b2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-866df96ed7f051acf60ebd0e82d9a19e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d068dbad68e3ecd909a551f43f82b893&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-39596f0742e3d89f278017df88b8065b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21bee96879472a1c6df454d862dc9e90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e3ac1a351ece6e7f29ea15d8b1c721d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9528beb2e85a7fb89449a9233eb979bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5338aa2127367c868a3e7331e1f66225&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03f2fc4d98412efb8a792474cc47e558&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bce368b44455642f4b9a1dacc4cdf0f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8cede90fd3b3eee0bd12d582eaa7d54c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c8dab62f56f2bfabf08bfe99049386a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c6ced866009d759592c16009bc619b4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-38a07d29ecfa06f82d97e69f5cd2c801&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44e006d8af33633a06dac6789334329d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b759b81206d0e33e320f2d61e540ae47&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5d6035f4b0686837c8c4319bab80d70&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-648afbc8ee82935d4026f5915152491c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6e05bc34fccfca5e177064daf8346866&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc908e62eec4d1d05265c6e451cca84c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-df045e015825dac8935c9c6d8a402cda&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2dafca19c0156f11127587dba3673503&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eaf641df5c55c7ff41895611514cdd22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf54b3c2c01c935a178261a31b8ed897&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03980ce7209ce3f1b1c62c6ed9961e27&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-33180d5b7e1ebfedf8de59ba1a2a2d04&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bdf2753a9a78b282c1ca2c0539e3203d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56f83fc7c1ea25f2ead74aceccfe4cf2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-00a6288e1109e01eac1ce7ecb35f2eda&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59defb995f5b0409c31d1922916c2f22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6aab9d327fcd7d10b5d4fbb22c03292a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cbdeaa1a437ba819412de45788aa119c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3891caf14683493be3d8709ced467492&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-939f85d52d9301668deab282264e5fd9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ac276660dd76d0ef97a8a0b1a59664c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1684575ed5f73a2ebe1adc7fbbb3b942&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-95142a3f585446bd848eeedadd1ab713&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3bd104d06a1ede06701ecfa96bccc2c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-602bba09eb2c308c400b412f39f4adb9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7232abef4870641de7945afeb6a4bf93&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-630d06d8ab372b4cadd7e3772d8fa1fc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9bc3253e8d41785f994d1c6fcc2b6c47&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eada60ee606520104bb515c4896d6b0b</data>
