    <edge source="BIODEGRADATION" target="G. MELLONELLA">
      <data key="d3">15.0</data>
      <data key="d4">G. mellonella larvae play a role in the biodegradation of polyethylene, with gut microbiota and enzymatic pathways facilitating the process.&lt;SEP&gt;The gut microbiota of Galleria mellonella plays a role in the biodegradation of plastics, such as Styrofoam.</data>
      <data key="d5">7&lt;SEP&gt;8</data>
