      <data key="d3">13.0</data>
      <data key="d4">HDPE is more resistant to biodegradation due to its high crystallinity and closely packed linear chains&lt;SEP&gt;High-density polyethylene (HDPE) is a plastic polymer that can be biodegraded by certain insect larvae, contributing to environmental sustainability.</data>
      <data key="d5">6&lt;SEP&gt;7</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-dd1ab39969c669dba42f162e8497c23f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f75b58db5211fc7348ccca8206b9bbae</data>
