    <edge source="BIODEGRADATION" target="LARVAE">
      <data key="d3">45.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Larvae play a key role in the biodegradation of PET through their consumption and gut microbiome activity.&lt;SEP&gt;Larvae play a key role in the biodegradation of PET through their consumption and gut microbiome activity.&lt;SEP&gt;Larvae play a key role in the biodegradation of polystyrene, as their gut microbiota contributes to the breakdown process.&lt;SEP&gt;Larvae play a key role in the biodegradation of synthetic polymers, with their frass analyzed to determine degradation rates.&lt;SEP&gt;Larvae play a significant role in the biodegradation of plastics, including PLA, PS, and PVC, through their digestive processes.</data>
