      <data key="d3">15.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Carbonyl groups are formed during the biodegradation of polystyrene by mealworms, indicating chemical changes in the polymer structure.&lt;SEP&gt;The formation of carbonyl groups in frass indicates the breakdown of polystyrene during biodegradation.</data>
