      <data key="d3">15.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Hydroxyl groups are detected in frass samples, indicating a shift from hydrophobic to hydrophilic properties during polystyrene biodegradation.&lt;SEP&gt;Hydroxyl groups detected in frass suggest the formation of hydrogen bonds and carboxylic acids during polystyrene biodegradation.</data>
