      <data key="d3">16.0</data>
      <data key="d4">CO2 production is a key indicator of the mineralization and biodegradation of polystyrene by the gut microbiome.&lt;SEP&gt;CO2 production is a key indicator of the mineralization of polystyrene during biodegradation by PS-degrading bacteria.</data>
      <data key="d5">8</data>
