      <data key="d4">The gut microbiome of mealworms is essential for the biodegradation of polystyrene, demonstrating the role of microorganisms in waste management.&lt;SEP&gt;The mealworm gut microbiome plays a key role in the biodegradation of plastics, including polystyrene, through microbial activity.&lt;SEP&gt;The mealworm gut microbiome plays a key role in the biodegradation of polystyrene (PS).</data>
      <data key="d5">9</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-eba752cb179633f5dd054ee7c9ee2cba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d99a98d885ec6495c4dc902866c4ab9f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-85fe36521680f0d09a603eab04706561</data>
