      <data key="d3">24.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Stable isotope analysis is used to assess the biodegradation of petroleum-derived plastics, providing insights into the degradation process.&lt;SEP&gt;Stable isotope analysis is used to monitor the biodegradation of plastics by measuring isotopic exchange during the degradation process.&lt;SEP&gt;Stable isotope analysis is used to monitor the biodegradation of plastics by measuring isotopic exchange during the degradation process.</data>
