      <data key="d3">16.0</data>
      <data key="d4">The pyralid moth family includes insect larvae capable of biodegrading petroleum-based plastics through digestive enzymes in their gut.&lt;SEP&gt;The pyralid moth family includes insect larvae capable of biodegrading petroleum-based plastics.</data>
