      <data key="d3">41.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Gut microbiomes in Tenebrio molitor and Zophobas atratus larvae are essential for the biodegradation of plastics like PP, PS, and LDPE.&lt;SEP&gt;The gut microbiomes of mealworms play a key role in the biodegradation of PET intermediates, enhancing the degradation process.</data>
      <data key="d5">8&lt;SEP&gt;9</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-c638e6375f0847be0d1116f4846e5e1b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0caad5c42a4b470a8c41ac3fb68c1f64</data>
    </edge>
