      <data key="d6">chunk-79c11bccb4ef9bd152bdae9b5c2c5c8c</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="BIODEGRADATION" target="PET">
      <data key="d3">100.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Biodegradation is the process by which PET is broken down into smaller molecules by larvae and their gut microbiome.&lt;SEP&gt;Biodegradation is the process by which PET is broken down into smaller molecules by larvae and their gut microbiome.&lt;SEP&gt;Biodegradation of PET by Tenebrio molitor larvae involves the breakdown of the polymer into smaller molecules, influenced by molecular weight and crystallinity.&lt;SEP&gt;PET is a target of biodegradation studies, particularly in organisms like Tenebrio molitor, which can break it down.&lt;SEP&gt;PET is biodegraded by Tenebrio molitor larvae through a combination of mechanical chewing and enzymatic activity from gut microbes.&lt;SEP&gt;PET is biodegraded by Tenebrio molitor larvae, with the process being independent of gut microbes.&lt;SEP&gt;PET is biodegraded by Tenebrio molitor larvae, with the process influenced by polymer size and the adaptation of the gut microbiome.&lt;SEP&gt;Biodegradation of PET by Tenebrio molitor larvae involves the breakdown of the polymer into smaller molecules, influenced by molecular weight and crystallinity.&lt;SEP&gt;PET is a target of biodegradation studies, particularly in organisms like Tenebrio molitor, which can break it down.&lt;SEP&gt;PET is biodegraded by Tenebrio molitor larvae through a combination of mechanical chewing and enzymatic activity from gut microbes.&lt;SEP&gt;PET is biodegraded by Tenebrio molitor larvae, with the process being independent of gut microbes.&lt;SEP&gt;PET is biodegraded by Tenebrio molitor larvae, with the process influenced by polymer size and the adaptation of the gut microbiome.</data>
      <data key="d5">8&lt;SEP&gt;9</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-e69c793c3b67aed7a68bf864c2c7a309&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e24cc3865ed97850c3f25795ff514e8d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-69679184959639a1ff81c7392cd5cef5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c426315f0f412528b9c6fb2a82dff2c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b19ac5bdc755bb8e9deb8e317ce365dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-411368ddb6a73777c1dd4c683bd389c0</data>
    </edge>
