      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Metabolism in Tenebrio molitor and Tenebrio obscurus larvae plays a crucial role in the biodegradation of polyethylene, including changes in gut microbiome and molecular weight.</data>
      <data key="d5">9</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-acbe3a2cb3a17985d07d15bed638bd90</data>
    </edge>
