      <data key="d4">The lesser waxworm contributes to the biodegradation of polyethylene, with an average degradation rate of 1.83 mg of PE per day per larva.&lt;SEP&gt;The lesser waxworm plays a crucial role in the biodegradation of polyethylene, demonstrating its potential in addressing plastic pollution.</data>
