    </edge>
    <edge source="BIODEGRADATION" target="MI-PS">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Mi-PS is a target of biodegradation studies, focusing on the role of bacteria and insect larvae in breaking down polystyrene.</data>
