    </edge>
    <edge source="BIODEGRADATION" target="AGED POLYETHYLENE (PE)">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Aged polyethylene (PE) microplastics are more efficiently biodegraded by Tenebrio molitor larvae compared to pristine MPs.</data>
      <data key="d5">8</data>
