    </edge>
    <edge source="BIODEGRADATION" target="REDUNDANCY ANALYSIS (RDA)">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Redundancy analysis (RDA) is used to verify the effectiveness of aged microplastic biodegradation by Tenebrio molitor larvae.</data>
      <data key="d5">8</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-7367fc6115c08ae427a6e9e91eaa1de3</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="BIODEGRADATION" target="SUSTAINABLE SOLUTIONS">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Biodegradation by Tenebrio molitor larvae is a sustainable solution for addressing microplastic pollution.</data>
