      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">1,3-Di-tert-butyl-2,5-dimethylbenzene is an antioxidant additive found in the frass of PS-fed Tenebrio molitor larvae, indicating polystyrene biodegradation.</data>
