    <edge source="BIODEGRADATION" target="AGED MICROPLASTICS">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Biodegradation of aged microplastics is facilitated by the gut microbial community of Tenebrio molitor larvae, which breaks down the plastic into smaller monomers.</data>
