    <edge source="BIODEGRADATION" target="Δ13C SIGNATURE">
      <data key="d3">17.0</data>
      <data key="d4">The δ13C signature is used to verify the biodegradation of plastics by mealworms.&lt;SEP&gt;The δ13C signature method is used to assess the biodegradation of commercial plastics in mealworms by analyzing isotopic changes in residual plastics.</data>
      <data key="d5">8&lt;SEP&gt;9</data>
