    <edge source="BIODEGRADATION" target="HIGH-PURITY PS MICROPLASTICS">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">High-purity PS microplastics are used to study the biodegradation capabilities of mealworms, with degradation efficiency influenced by molecular weight.</data>
