    </edge>
    <edge source="BIODEGRADATION" target="GUT MICROBIAL POPULATIONS">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Gut microbial populations in mealworms are strongly associated with the biodegradation of polystyrene, with distinct communities for different molecular weights.</data>
      <data key="d5">8</data>
