    <edge source="BIODEGRADATION" target="POLYSTYRENE MICROPLASTICS (PS MPS)">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Biodegradation is the process by which mealworms break down polystyrene microplastics into smaller components</data>
      <data key="d5">9</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-c9af0d95fd5f52d02b9cb33387951963</data>
