      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Mealworms can depolymerize the long-chain structures of microplastics, contributing to their biodegradation.</data>
      <data key="d5">8</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-640f0655e17fab473cca3b460c2795de</data>
