      <data key="d3">24.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Changes in molecular weight distribution (MWD) indicate the extent of depolymerization of LDPE by mealworms.&lt;SEP&gt;MWD analysis shows a decrease in molecular weight of residual polystyrene, indicating depolymerization during biodegradation.&lt;SEP&gt;Molecular weight distribution (MWD) changes during depolymerization, reflecting the breakdown of polymer chains into smaller molecules.</data>
      <data key="d5">7&lt;SEP&gt;8&lt;SEP&gt;9</data>
