      <data key="d3">24.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Depolymerization of polystyrene (PS) is evidenced by the chemical changes observed in the egested frass of mealworms.&lt;SEP&gt;Egested frass from larvae contains evidence of PP depolymerization, including residual polymers and partially degraded intermediates.</data>
      <data key="d5">8</data>
