      <data key="d3">15.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Cladosporium pseudocladosporioides can degrade polyether-PU, contributing to its biodegradation.&lt;SEP&gt;Cladosporium pseudocladosporioides degrades polyether-PU polymers, contributing to biodegradation</data>
