      <data key="d3">14.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Bran is used as a control diet for mealworms to compare the effects of natural versus plastic diets.&lt;SEP&gt;Bran supplementation can mitigate the harmful effects of microplastic consumption on mealworms, improving their growth and survival.</data>
