      <data key="d4">Bran is a key component of Diet 2, used in feeding experiments with Tenebrio molitor larvae to study polystyrene biodegradation.&lt;SEP&gt;Bran was a key component of Diet 2, influencing the gut microbiome and PS consumption of mealworms.</data>
