      <data key="d4">Bran increases the consumption of polystyrene (PS) by mealworms and superworms, enhancing their ability to degrade PS.&lt;SEP&gt;Bran is mixed with polystyrene in varying ratios to study its effect on the biodegradation process and the formation of oligomers.</data>
