      <data key="d3">30.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Bran increases the consumption of polystyrene by superworms.&lt;SEP&gt;Bran increases the rate of polystyrene (PS) consumption by superworms, aiding in the biodegradation process.&lt;SEP&gt;Superworms fed with bran show higher survival and pupation rates compared to those fed with PS or PU, indicating the importance of nutrients in their development.&lt;SEP&gt;Bran is used as a control feed for superworms to compare the effects of polystyrene (PS) consumption on their growth and survival.</data>
