      <data key="d3">25.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Bran is used as a nutrient-rich control food source for Tenebrio molitor larvae, supporting their growth and survival.&lt;SEP&gt;Bran supplementation alleviates the negative impacts of microplastics on Tenebrio molitor larvae, maintaining their nutrient levels and physiological performance.&lt;SEP&gt;Supplementation of bran reduces oxidative stress and enhances the biodegradation of microplastics in Tenebrio molitor larvae.</data>
