      <data key="d3">16.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Bran supplementation enhances the plastic biodegradation efficiency of larvae, particularly for PLA, PS, and PVC.&lt;SEP&gt;Bran was used as a control diet for larvae, providing a baseline for ROS levels in comparison to larvae fed with different plastics.</data>
