    <edge source="FRASS" target="TENEBRIO MOLITOR">
      <data key="d3">164.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Frass, the waste material excreted by Tenebrio molitor (mealworm) larvae, is a byproduct of their consumption and biodegradation of various plastics, including polystyrene (PS), polyethylene terephthalate (PET), polypropylene (PP), low-density polyethylene (LDPE), and expanded polystyrene (EPS). The frass contains residual polymers, degraded plastic products, and organic compounds resulting from the larvae's ability to modify, oxidize, and break down these plastics. This process provides evidence of the larvae's biodegradation capabilities, as the frass is analyzed to determine the efficiency of plastic degradation and to study the extent of depolymerization.

The frass from Tenebrio molitor larvae is not only a marker of plastic biodegradation but also has potential applications in agriculture, construction, and recycling processes. However, it may also contain microplastics or toxic substances, which could pose ecological risks if not managed properly. Researchers analyze the frass to explore its potential future uses and to better understand the biodegradation mechanisms of different plastics, such as PET, PS, PP, and LDPE, by Tenebrio molitor larvae. Overall, frass serves as a critical indicator of the larvae's role in plastic waste management and their potential contribution to sustainable recycling solutions.</data>
      <data key="d5">7&lt;SEP&gt;8&lt;SEP&gt;9</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-edd352a71a8bc6e66ece9484f8b59118&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d8c6850a83a1c6efd4f1a3a37a0a8181&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-39596f0742e3d89f278017df88b8065b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e5a7fb8d6a76ecfbfc810f952bfba090&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-568e2e90ce0d3bbb4e21079f4252f5de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e3f0582a5d7e55961a1ce4d971d3e4a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-98d4ea946a931acf7e5a8292c30ea4c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bfe58fb1bbaa5c35e9c6c837d0b1050f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-846559469c70e081884fea2f9a4b7317&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f141d484320c21ec01b892a9b7d56486&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-152e743d95b64fab136afadf0304d459&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e7df3b1ec42b9ac5c08513c3b568a399&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-110013d54a5fd492446b1fe049a60fe9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f61cd3a131593ce6b058802713d43ddb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-02e6f7bbb2c1ef92c57b423020b0cc5c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89ff8edff56325c22cfed3871f4fbf48&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-57edc76f6646a41c4845d94baa519950&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-68c274a59cd5db4cd675bca51f11adb6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a5710c6b3eb755779f706360ec72260e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24ba7d6b1b5275089cbabe56bc33b92e</data>
    </edge>
