      <data key="d3">14.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Rhizobiales bacteria in the digestive tract of Tenebrio molitor play a role in nitrogen fixation and symbiotic relationships with the larvae.&lt;SEP&gt;Rhizobiales bacteria in the digestive tract of mealworms facilitate nitrogen fixation, aiding in the larvae's survival and growth.</data>
      <data key="d5">7</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-edad11f4e8936fcfb69f8616ad364f18&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d13e8c770c847882a94a6b78b0979cc</data>
