    <edge source="TENEBRIO MOLITOR" target="NITROSPIRA SP.">
      <data key="d3">14.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Nitrosopira sp. bacteria in the digestive tract of Tenebrio molitor are involved in nitrification and nitrogen cycling, supporting the larvae's growth.&lt;SEP&gt;Nitrosopira sp. bacteria in the digestive tract of mealworms contribute to nitrification, enhancing nitrogen availability.</data>
      <data key="d5">7</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-edad11f4e8936fcfb69f8616ad364f18&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d13e8c770c847882a94a6b78b0979cc</data>
