      <data key="d3">14.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Spiroplasma spp. are predominant bacteria in mealworm larvae fed bran, polystyrene, and polyethylene, influencing their gut microbiome.&lt;SEP&gt;Spiroplasma spp. are predominant in the gut microbiome of Tenebrio molitor, contributing to its ability to degrade polymers.</data>
      <data key="d5">7</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-edad11f4e8936fcfb69f8616ad364f18&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d13e8c770c847882a94a6b78b0979cc</data>
