      <data key="d3">25.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Proteobacteria supply Tenebrio molitor with amino acids and are predominant in its digestive tract.&lt;SEP&gt;Proteobacteria, including Pseudomonas and Achromobacter species, are major contributors to polystyrene biodegradation in the gut of Tenebrio molitor.&lt;SEP&gt;Proteobacteria supply mealworms with amino acids and are predominant in their digestive tract.</data>
