      <data key="d3">17.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Metabolic pathways in mealworms were studied to understand the mechanism of plastic degradation, particularly for PS and PE.&lt;SEP&gt;Tenebrio molitor larvae utilize metabolic pathways to degrade polystyrene and lignocellulose, producing energy and intermediates.</data>
      <data key="d5">8&lt;SEP&gt;9</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-ca86254d65e47c4049e193cf2098b964&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-566d464a7713ef7ca266f3d5f24a1a59</data>
    </edge>
