    <edge source="TENEBRIO MOLITOR" target="N-ACETYLTRANSFERASE (NAT)">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">NAT is involved in the metabolism of plastic degradation intermediates in mealworms, similar to its role in isoniazid metabolism.</data>
      <data key="d5">7</data>
