    <edge source="TENEBRIO MOLITOR" target="TOXICOLOGICAL ASSESSMENT">
      <data key="d3">131.0</data>
      <data key="d4">A toxicological assessment is conducted to evaluate the physiological stress responses and oxidative stress in Tenebrio molitor larvae during plastic biodegradation.&lt;SEP&gt;The biodegradation of plastics by Tenebrio molitor produces toxicity, which is evaluated through toxicological assessments.&lt;SEP&gt;Toxicological assessments are conducted to determine the safety of Tenebrio molitor for consumption after degrading Styrofoam.&lt;SEP&gt;Toxicological assessments are conducted to evaluate the effects of plastic biodegradation by mealworms on their health.&lt;SEP&gt;Toxicological assessments have been conducted to evaluate the safety of Tenebrio molitor as a food source for animals and humans.&lt;SEP&gt;Toxicological assessments are conducted to evaluate the safety and environmental impact of residual plastics and byproducts from mealworm-mediated biodegradation.&lt;SEP&gt;The morphological parameters of Tenebrio molitor larvae were monitored to assess the impact of plastic consumption on their growth and development, indicating a toxicological assessment.&lt;SEP&gt;Toxicological assessments are conducted to evaluate the effects of plastic diets on the growth, development, and survival of Tenebrio molitor larvae.&lt;SEP&gt;Toxicological assessment is used to study the effects of polyethylene degradation on mealworms, including oxidative stress.&lt;SEP&gt;The study evaluates the toxicological effects of plastic ingestion on yellow mealworms, including mortality and growth inhibition.&lt;SEP&gt;Toxicological assessments were conducted to evaluate the effects of polystyrene consumption on mealworms, including biochemical and genomic analyses.&lt;SEP&gt;Toxicological assessments are conducted to evaluate the effects of microplastic ingestion on Tenebrio molitor larvae.&lt;SEP&gt;Toxicological assessments are conducted to evaluate the safety of mealworms as a potential food source.&lt;SEP&gt;Toxicological assessment evaluates the effects of polystyrene foam on mealworms, including survival, growth, and reproduction.&lt;SEP&gt;Toxicological assessments have been conducted to evaluate the safety of Tenebrio molitor for consumption.&lt;SEP&gt;Toxicological assessment is conducted to evaluate the effects of plastic degradation by Tenebrio molitor and the fate of chemicals like HBCD.</data>
      <data key="d5">7&lt;SEP&gt;8</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-65434948dabde813d99972f40a04d8de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5279ebea7d4d5e22eebe3106de3ba1c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-78cd8d4684fa9e0519635dba9f124a08&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-95142a3f585446bd848eeedadd1ab713&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-372aa232f6e8aad1d8e0a93f16a42b0c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4cdbea1d06006b95d57c8b628d9e3f8f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64a060d0c9650ae8bed2ca9b44eef10c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d068dbad68e3ecd909a551f43f82b893&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-32f340b7166025be3c56178a94ae480d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6cc0afd02f25b584d6e3a755fc7272b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-36b964b1825429cad2c7d13c1ea8827e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5338aa2127367c868a3e7331e1f66225&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6264a99190316d0aeed63b5d6485999e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-104d99248e84b2776ff5ca17c285a7bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6e356bad5f8c2dd9188b38c0d9462b9c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-74e2601f950d62c093ceb86612b2374f</data>
    </edge>
