    <edge source="TENEBRIO MOLITOR" target="PET MICROPLASTICS">
      <data key="d3">25.0</data>
      <data key="d4">PET microplastics are consumed and biodegraded by Tenebrio molitor, highlighting their role in plastic degradation.&lt;SEP&gt;PET microplastics are consumed and biodegraded by Tenebrio molitor, highlighting their role in plastic degradation.&lt;SEP&gt;Tenebrio molitor larvae actively consume and biodegrade PET microplastics, utilizing them as an energy source.</data>
