    <edge source="TENEBRIO MOLITOR" target="AGAR">
      <data key="d3">34.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Agar is used as a control diet for mealworms in biodegradation experiments.&lt;SEP&gt;Agar is used as a control diet for mealworms in biodegradation experiments.&lt;SEP&gt;Agar is used as a control diet to compare the survival rates of Tenebrio molitor larvae when fed with PET-agar mixtures.&lt;SEP&gt;Agar is used to create agar-PET gel, which is fed to Tenebrio molitor larvae to study their ability to digest and biodegrade PET.&lt;SEP&gt;Agar is used as a medium to feed mealworms PP polymers, facilitating the study of PP biodegradation.</data>
