      <data key="d3">15.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Nanoplastics (NPs) were not detected in the frass of PE-fed and PS-fed Tenebrio molitor larvae, indicating their absence after digestion.&lt;SEP&gt;Nanoplastics were not detected in the frass of Tenebrio molitor larvae, suggesting efficient degradation of plastics like PE and PS.</data>
