    <edge source="TENEBRIO MOLITOR" target="GENTAMICIN SULFATE">
      <data key="d3">57.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Gentamicin sulfate is used to suppress gut bacteria in Tenebrio molitor larvae, affecting their ability to biodegrade plastics.&lt;SEP&gt;Gentamicin sulfate suppresses gut bacteria in Tenebrio molitor larvae, affecting their ability to biodegrade PET.&lt;SEP&gt;Gentamicin sulfate suppresses the gut bacteria of Tenebrio molitor larvae, negatively impacting their ability to biodegrade plastics.&lt;SEP&gt;Gentamicin sulfate suppresses gut bacteria in mealworms, reducing their ability to degrade PET.&lt;SEP&gt;Gentamicin sulfate suppresses gut bacteria in mealworms, reducing their ability to degrade PET.&lt;SEP&gt;Gentamicin sulfate suppresses gut bacteria in mealworms, which can negatively impact their ability to degrade polystyrene&lt;SEP&gt;Gentamicin sulfate is used to suppress gut bacteria in Tenebrio molitor larvae, affecting their ability to degrade LDPE&lt;SEP&gt;Gentamicin sulfate is used to suppress gut bacteria in Tenebrio molitor, affecting their ability to biodegrade LDPE</data>
