    <edge source="TENEBRIO MOLITOR" target="GUT MICROBES">
      <data key="d3">110.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Gut microbes in Tenebrio molitor are essential for the biodegradation of plastics, although some biodegradation can occur independently of them.&lt;SEP&gt;Gut microbes in Tenebrio molitor larvae are essential for the biodegradation of certain plastics, such as PS and PVC.&lt;SEP&gt;The gut microbes of Tenebrio molitor are essential for the biodegradation of plastics like polystyrene and polyethylene.&lt;SEP&gt;The gut microbes of Tenebrio molitor larvae are essential for the biodegradation of PET, as they produce enzymes that depolymerize the plastic.&lt;SEP&gt;The gut microbes of Tenebrio molitor larvae are essential for the biodegradation of PET, as they produce enzymes that depolymerize the plastic.&lt;SEP&gt;The gut microbes of Tenebrio molitor play a crucial role in the biodegradation of plastics, including polyethylene and polyvinyl chloride.&lt;SEP&gt;Gut microbes in Tenebrio molitor larvae play a crucial role in the biodegradation of polypropylene (PP).&lt;SEP&gt;Gut microbes in Tenebrio molitor larvae play a crucial role in the biodegradation of polypropylene foam.&lt;SEP&gt;Gut microbes in Tenebrio molitor larvae play a crucial role in the biodegradation of various plastics, including polystyrene, polyethylene, and polypropylene.&lt;SEP&gt;Gut microbes in Tenebrio molitor larvae enhance the biodegradation of LDPE, playing a role in the depolymerization process.&lt;SEP&gt;Gut microbes in Tenebrio molitor play a significant role in the biodegradation of LDPE.&lt;SEP&gt;The gut microbes of Tenebrio molitor are essential for the biodegradation of polystyrene and polypropylene.</data>
      <data key="d5">7&lt;SEP&gt;8&lt;SEP&gt;9</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-f8ee8f544a1849c80a5a1524c4f2674c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b19ac5bdc755bb8e9deb8e317ce365dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c2cfbb4289b0cc4c8b69884f6d57c447&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64a060d0c9650ae8bed2ca9b44eef10c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e4b3c26a06ad850bb97d0ca2d9217be1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d068dbad68e3ecd909a551f43f82b893&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4265fd894f71345b4ef09c26e6adbda5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5050676818c53a0ef6d691d3049e923c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-68c274a59cd5db4cd675bca51f11adb6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89a76f613b36454134940f78fba1c0f6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b74f16813537103549cdcb6770abaea</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="TENEBRIO MOLITOR" target="TOXICITY">
