      <data key="d3">14.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Spiroplasma bacteria are present in the gut of mealworms but do not harm them, despite being known insect pathogens.&lt;SEP&gt;Spiroplasma is a bacterial genus identified in the gut microbiome of mealworms, especially in the control diet.</data>
      <data key="d5">7</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-f2122660fcfebecf752000198a16f222&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-32f340b7166025be3c56178a94ae480d</data>
