      <data key="d4">Chryseobacterium is a bacterial genus identified in the gut microbiome of mealworms, particularly in Diet 3.&lt;SEP&gt;Chryseobacterium may play a role in the degradation of polyurethane in the gut of Tenebrio molitor larvae.</data>
