    <edge source="TENEBRIO MOLITOR" target="DIET 1">
      <data key="d3">15.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Diet 1 (low bran:polystyrene ratio) was used to study the effects on Tenebrio molitor's gut microbiota and polystyrene biodegradation.&lt;SEP&gt;Diet 1 is used to assess the effect of polystyrene supplementation on Tenebrio molitor larvae.</data>
      <data key="d5">7&lt;SEP&gt;8</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-6e415042ae4079ee5fe96c7105eb534c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b4ab01931acbc7aa9c77cd03531c57e</data>
