      <data key="d3">16.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Diet 2 (high bran:polystyrene ratio + water) was used to study the effects on Tenebrio molitor's gut microbiota and polystyrene biodegradation.&lt;SEP&gt;Diet 2 is used to study the effect of hydration on the metabolism of polystyrene by Tenebrio molitor larvae.</data>
      <data key="d5">8</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-6e415042ae4079ee5fe96c7105eb534c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b4ab01931acbc7aa9c77cd03531c57e</data>
