      <data key="d3">15.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Tenebrio molitor larvae are capable of degrading lignin materials in rice straw, corn straw, and wheat straw, which may be related to their plastic degradation capacity.&lt;SEP&gt;Tenebrio molitor larvae can degrade lignin, which may contribute to their ability to degrade plastics such as polystyrene (PS) and low-density polyethylene (LDPE).</data>
