      <data key="d3">16.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Biochemical analyses revealed significant differences in protein, sugar, and lipid content in mealworms fed with different types of polystyrene.&lt;SEP&gt;Biochemical analyses were performed to assess the effects of plastic degradation on the total sugar, lipid, and protein content in mealworms.</data>
