    <edge source="TENEBRIO MOLITOR" target="RAW POLYSTYRENE (PS)">
      <data key="d3">16.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Mealworms (Tenebrio molitor) are capable of chewing and digesting raw polystyrene, contributing to its biodegradation.&lt;SEP&gt;Raw polystyrene (PS) caused the highest mass loss in mealworms, indicating it is not a viable food source for larvae.</data>
      <data key="d5">8</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-06a44b308af148551c5b7feef324d88b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a11793261251544a542146bc9bf0c5dd</data>
