    </edge>
    <edge source="TENEBRIO MOLITOR" target="IMAGO">
      <data key="d3">14.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Imago (adult mealworms) showed minimal mass changes when fed with polystyrene, indicating limited impact on adult development.&lt;SEP&gt;Imago is the adult stage of Tenebrio molitor, with counts varying significantly based on feed type.</data>
      <data key="d5">6&lt;SEP&gt;8</data>
