    </edge>
    <edge source="TENEBRIO MOLITOR" target="CONTROL GROUP">
      <data key="d3">17.0</data>
      <data key="d4">The control group consists of Tenebrio molitor larvae maintained under acclimation conditions without exposure to polystyrene.&lt;SEP&gt;The control group fed with oatmeal showed a 36% mass increase, highlighting the negative impact of polystyrene on mealworm growth.</data>
      <data key="d5">8&lt;SEP&gt;9</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-a11793261251544a542146bc9bf0c5dd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-39c4ff9e5812f88117b37503a70b0479</data>
    </edge>
