    <edge source="TENEBRIO MOLITOR" target="PROTEIN CONTENT">
      <data key="d3">24.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Protein content in feed positively impacts the growth and development of Tenebrio molitor larvae.&lt;SEP&gt;Protein content in mealworms remained constant when fed with polystyrene, indicating no nutritional benefit.&lt;SEP&gt;The protein content in Tenebrio molitor larvae was highest in the PS group and lowest in the OAT group, reflecting the nutritional impact of different diets.</data>
      <data key="d5">7&lt;SEP&gt;8&lt;SEP&gt;9</data>
