      <data key="d3">17.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Brandon et al. investigated the biodegradation of polyethylene and plastic mixtures in Tenebrio molitor larvae.&lt;SEP&gt;Brandon et al. studied the degradation of polyethylene and polystyrene mixtures by mealworms, though their mass balances were not fully closed.</data>
