    <edge source="TENEBRIO MOLITOR" target="SURVIVAL RATE">
      <data key="d3">46.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Survival rate is used to assess the health and viability of Tenebrio molitor larvae when fed different types of plastic.&lt;SEP&gt;Survival rate is used to evaluate the health of Tenebrio molitor larvae under different feeding conditions and antibiotic treatments&lt;SEP&gt;The survival rate of Tenebrio molitor larvae was assessed to determine the effects of feeding them polystyrene.&lt;SEP&gt;The survival rate of mealworms is influenced by their exposure to PE substrates and cannibalistic behavior.&lt;SEP&gt;The survival rate of Tenebrio molitor larvae is higher when fed with wheat bran compared to a polypropylene-only diet.&lt;SEP&gt;The survival rate of Tenebrio molitor larvae is influenced by feeding conditions, with dietary supplements improving longevity and PS degradation efficiency.</data>
      <data key="d5">7&lt;SEP&gt;8</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-1b21eb0db725b38c3e0b5c01526ce90b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f488d8d4434d57d1a775a22333caa04b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd3092744be0c66dad5833977dedd913&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d39fc863538a777920c4eafb37bcf8a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5740f0973ff804cae61f6fc12f3e3753&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a214d2b1c90aeb78e6e8562679d4963</data>
    </edge>
