    </edge>
    <edge source="TENEBRIO MOLITOR" target="PLASTIC WASTE">
      <data key="d3">24.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Mealworms have the potential to biodegrade plastic waste, offering a sustainable solution for waste management.&lt;SEP&gt;Tenebrio molitor larvae provide a potential solution for the biodegradation of plastic waste, including foam plastics.&lt;SEP&gt;Tenebrio molitor larvae can biodegrade plastic waste, including polypropylene (PP), contributing to environmental remediation.</data>
      <data key="d5">8</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-7106a16c81492914e4ba58e248689714&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9d7500fe4985cb2b885f9eb244ed3c2e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-196a7570e6cac531e94c1680c54f5491</data>
    </edge>
