    <edge source="TENEBRIO MOLITOR" target="METABOLIC STRESS">
      <data key="d3">14.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Mealworms experience metabolic stress when consuming polystyrene, as it is not a part of their typical diet and may affect their physiological processes.&lt;SEP&gt;Tenebrio molitor larvae undergo metabolic stress when consuming polystyrene, compared to their typical diet.</data>
      <data key="d5">7</data>
