      <data key="d4">Klebsiella oxytoca ATCC 13182 was isolated from the gut of Tenebrio molitor, suggesting its potential role in polystyrene degradation.&lt;SEP&gt;Klebsiella oxytoca ATCC 13182 was isolated from the guts of Tenebrio molitor and is potentially responsible for polystyrene biodegradation.</data>
