      <data key="d3">13.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Carrots are a potential supplemental nutrient that could be used in future studies to enhance EPS consumption rates by mealworms&lt;SEP&gt;Carrots were used as supplementary food for Tenebrio molitor larvae to assess their survival and development rates when fed with polystyrene.</data>
