      <data key="d3">30.0</data>
      <data key="d4">The life cycle of Tenebrio molitor is studied to understand its ability to survive and reproduce while consuming polystyrene.&lt;SEP&gt;The life cycle of Tenebrio molitor was monitored to assess the impact of polystyrene consumption on their development.&lt;SEP&gt;The life cycle of Tenebrio molitor is studied to understand their ability to complete development while feeding on polystyrene.&lt;SEP&gt;The life cycle of Tenebrio molitor larvae is studied to understand the effects of feed on their development and mortality.</data>
