      <data key="d4">Wheat flour is a nutritious food source for Tenebrio molitor larvae, supporting their biomass growth, unlike polystyrene.&lt;SEP&gt;Wheat flour is provided as a food source for Tenebrio molitor larvae during the acclimation period.</data>
