      <data key="d4">Bacillus bacteria are commonly found in the digestive tract of Tenebrio molitor and play a role in the degradation of polystyrene&lt;SEP&gt;Bacillus bacteria are part of the gut microbiome of mealworms, aiding in their digestion.</data>
      <data key="d5">7</data>
