      <data key="d4">Pantoea bacteria are found in the gut of mealworms, contributing to their digestive processes.&lt;SEP&gt;Pantoea bacteria are part of the gut microbiota of adult Tenebrio molitor, contributing to the overall microbial community</data>
      <data key="d5">6&lt;SEP&gt;7</data>
