    </edge>
    <edge source="TENEBRIO MOLITOR" target="PET MPS">
      <data key="d3">32.0</data>
      <data key="d4">PET MPs are consumed and biodegraded by Tenebrio molitor larvae, demonstrating their role in plastic degradation.&lt;SEP&gt;PET MPs are consumed and biodegraded by Tenebrio molitor larvae, demonstrating their role in plastic degradation.&lt;SEP&gt;Tenebrio molitor larvae consume and biodegrade PET MPs, demonstrating their ability to process microplastics.&lt;SEP&gt;Tenebrio molitor larvae consume and biodegrade PET MPs, demonstrating their ability to process microplastics.</data>
