    </edge>
    <edge source="TENEBRIO MOLITOR" target="PET1100">
      <data key="d3">34.0</data>
      <data key="d4">PET1100 is rapidly biodegraded by Tenebrio molitor larvae, with almost complete degradation observed due to its low molecular weight.&lt;SEP&gt;PET1100 is rapidly biodegraded by Tenebrio molitor larvae, with almost complete degradation observed due to its low molecular weight.&lt;SEP&gt;Tenebrio molitor larvae consume and biodegrade PET1100, a low-molecular-weight PET microplastic.&lt;SEP&gt;Tenebrio molitor larvae consume and biodegrade PET1100, a low-molecular-weight PET microplastic.</data>
      <data key="d5">8&lt;SEP&gt;9</data>
