    </edge>
    <edge source="TENEBRIO MOLITOR" target="PET27100">
      <data key="d3">32.0</data>
      <data key="d4">PET27100 is biodegraded by Tenebrio molitor larvae, with significant mass reduction observed, representing the molecular weight range of most commercial PET products.&lt;SEP&gt;PET27100 is biodegraded by Tenebrio molitor larvae, with significant mass reduction observed, representing the molecular weight range of most commercial PET products.&lt;SEP&gt;Tenebrio molitor larvae consume and biodegrade PET27100, a medium-molecular-weight PET microplastic.&lt;SEP&gt;Tenebrio molitor larvae consume and biodegrade PET27100, a medium-molecular-weight PET microplastic.</data>
      <data key="d5">8</data>
