    </edge>
    <edge source="TENEBRIO MOLITOR" target="PET63500">
      <data key="d3">30.0</data>
      <data key="d4">PET63500 is less efficiently biodegraded by Tenebrio molitor larvae compared to lower molecular weight PET polymers, but still shows notable mass reduction.&lt;SEP&gt;PET63500 is less efficiently biodegraded by Tenebrio molitor larvae compared to lower molecular weight PET polymers, but still shows notable mass reduction.&lt;SEP&gt;Tenebrio molitor larvae consume and biodegrade PET63500, a high-molecular-weight PET microplastic.&lt;SEP&gt;Tenebrio molitor larvae consume and biodegrade PET63500, a high-molecular-weight PET microplastic.</data>
      <data key="d5">7&lt;SEP&gt;8</data>
