      <data key="d4">Lemon-lime soda pre-treatment significantly increases the consumption rate of EPS by mealworms, likely due to its high acidity&lt;SEP&gt;Lemon-lime soda was used as a pre-treatment for EPS to enhance mealworm consumption rates.</data>
