      <data key="d3">18.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Gut microbe-dependent depolymerization is a key process in the biodegradation of plastics by Tenebrio molitor.&lt;SEP&gt;Tenebrio molitor relies on gut microbes to depolymerize plastics like polystyrene and polypropylene.</data>
