      <data key="d3">16.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Metabolic profiling is used to evaluate the biodegradation of expanded polystyrene by mealworm larvae.&lt;SEP&gt;Metabolic profiling is used to study the biodegradation of expanded polystyrene by Tenebrio molitor under different feeding strategies.</data>
      <data key="d5">8</data>
