      <data key="d3">24.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Microbiome diversity in Tenebrio molitor is crucial for understanding its ability to biodegrade polystyrene waste.&lt;SEP&gt;Microbiome diversity in Tenebrio molitor is studied to understand its role in polystyrene biodegradation.&lt;SEP&gt;Microbiome diversity in Tenebrio molitor is studied to understand the effects of polystyrene waste on gut microbial communities.</data>
      <data key="d5">8</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-f45bee9c7111e3b95e966d23c3a6223d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56604c68c2f6221f63a4afa5d457e8ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d4af956dbe737dee68ab6b9834fe2fcc</data>
