    <edge source="ZOPHOBAS ATRATUS" target="MICROBE-DEPENDENT DEPOLYMERIZATION">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Zophobas atratus larvae rely on gut microbiota for the depolymerization of plastics, such as polypropylene and polystyrene.</data>
      <data key="d5">8</data>
