      <data key="d4">Zophobas atratus consumes and biodegrades polystyrene, particularly when provided with wheat bran, aiding in EPS degradation.&lt;SEP&gt;Zophobas atratus larvae can biodegrade expanded polystyrene (EPS) through both broad and limited extent depolymerization.</data>
