      <data key="d3">36.0</data>
      <data key="d4">The gut microbiota of Zophobas atratus is essential for the biodegradation of plastics like PP and PS.&lt;SEP&gt;The gut microbiota of Zophobas atratus is essential for the biodegradation of plastics, including polypropylene (PP)&lt;SEP&gt;The gut microbiota of superworms plays a key role in the biodegradation of polystyrene, as evidenced by the inhibition of degradation when gut bacteria are suppressed.&lt;SEP&gt;The gut microbiota of Zophobas atratus larvae plays a crucial role in the biodegradation of polypropylene, aiding in the depolymerization process.</data>
