    <edge source="POLYETHYLENE (PE)" target="YELLOW MEALWORM">
      <data key="d3">24.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Yellow mealworm larvae can degrade polyethylene, converting it into CO2 and reducing its molecular weight&lt;SEP&gt;Yellow mealworms can degrade polyethylene (PE), converting a significant portion of it into CO2 and reducing its molecular weight&lt;SEP&gt;Yellow mealworms can degrade polyethylene, with a degradation rate of up to 20.7%, demonstrating their ability to break down this plastic.</data>
