    </edge>
    <edge source="POLYETHYLENE (PE)" target="LIGNIN">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Lignin and polyethylene share similar chemical structures, allowing lignin-degrading enzymes to potentially degrade polyethylene.</data>
      <data key="d5">7</data>
