    <edge source="POLYSTYRENE (PS)" target="EXIGUOBACTERIUM SP. YT2">
      <data key="d3">88.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Exiguobacterium sp. YT2 degrades polystyrene (PS) by up to 7.4% over 60 days, indicating its role in PS biodegradation.&lt;SEP&gt;Exiguobacterium sp. YT2 is a bacterium isolated from mealworm guts, known for its ability to degrade polystyrene (PS).&lt;SEP&gt;Exiguobacterium sp. strain YT2 can degrade polystyrene (PS), indicating its role in the biodegradation process.&lt;SEP&gt;Exiguobacterium sp. strain YT2 is capable of degrading polystyrene (PS), contributing to plastic biodegradation.&lt;SEP&gt;Exiguobacterium sp. strain YT2 is a bacterial strain capable of degrading polystyrene (PS) and forming biofilms on PS film surfaces.&lt;SEP&gt;Exiguobacterium sp. strain YT2 is capable of degrading polystyrene, demonstrating the role of gut bacteria in plastic biodegradation.&lt;SEP&gt;Exiguobacterium sp. strain YT2 is a bacterial strain that can degrade polystyrene (PS), indicating its role in the biodegradation process.&lt;SEP&gt;Exiguobacterium sp. strain YT2 is a bacterial strain that can degrade polystyrene, indicating its role in the biodegradation process.&lt;SEP&gt;Exiguobacterium sp. strain YT2 is a bacterial strain that can degrade polystyrene, indicating its role in the biodegradation process.&lt;SEP&gt;Exiguobacterium sp. YT2 is a bacterial strain that degrades polystyrene, highlighting its importance in the biodegradation process.&lt;SEP&gt;Exiguobacterium sp. strain YT2 is a bacterial strain capable of degrading polystyrene, highlighting the role of gut bacteria in the biodegradation process.</data>
      <data key="d5">8</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-bfd05eac1abc28ac416e6a56ccd6a9d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a52fc2936b4d2a771dbc2d6a37eeb710&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b7c2ef16f6809388c0c1a87c26bd5c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dfcb17715cb4e5148b33061c1b6cbf1c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c39e41f4f36c9c6854fa71508c35a08&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-06ba9ca61fb4f42582bbf7bd00ff0005&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-92bf00317a1d0d9ffccab121661a18a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6bd3778dedc6a0463017df9f8d6396eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ddb3edd44829125161ad624ea793ae71&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8e38968f22c4cd9bef3f1562e4ca47e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-49ebafd73759fc2bf3d4a642ccad96e9</data>
