    <edge source="POLYSTYRENE (PS)" target="SUPERWORMS">
      <data key="d3">88.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Superworms are capable of degrading polystyrene (PS), offering a potential solution for plastic waste management.&lt;SEP&gt;Superworms can consume and biodegrade polystyrene (PS), with significant molecular weight reduction observed after ingestion.&lt;SEP&gt;Superworms have been observed to degrade polystyrene (PS), with changes in their gut microbiome composition in response to PS diets.&lt;SEP&gt;Superworms were fed polystyrene (PS) as a sole diet, showing intermediate survival rates compared to bran-fed and PE-fed groups.&lt;SEP&gt;Superworms consume polystyrene, contributing to its biodegradation and potential waste management solutions.&lt;SEP&gt;Superworms consume polystyrene, contributing to its biodegradation.&lt;SEP&gt;Superworms, like mealworms, are capable of degrading polystyrene, with Pseudomonas aeruginosa isolated from their gut microbiome.&lt;SEP&gt;Superworms depolymerize long-chain polystyrene molecules into low molecular-weight degradation products, aiding in its biodegradation.&lt;SEP&gt;Superworms exhibit a preference for ingesting polystyrene (PS) foam and degrade it through oxidation and depolymerization processes in their guts.&lt;SEP&gt;Superworms were fed polystyrene (PS) to study their survival and growth, showing 100% survival rates.&lt;SEP&gt;Superworms consume and degrade polystyrene (PS), leading to significant weight loss and survival rates.</data>
      <data key="d5">7&lt;SEP&gt;8&lt;SEP&gt;9</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-497648a1cf8e41fac896250ae1eebbb1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-12ceb4368e146509caa737d9534ce3c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eda80cb027c8107defa00011d491b002&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-671dc96f9c648fdc6d21397c515d171d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-705bf68703e5d236b2ffabb7ecb3de5e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dbb6f13dbe3de759712fa3a0c9780470&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1f0f043d44950fae05e8207a298d4a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-99f8bb992751f8875d9449507e9c46ad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a38c714e7f1f701ec1149e25910e16e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-16810fc8beb169dfca32904d41bd992b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44565f26e7290c5eb0f26935608a5f16</data>
    </edge>
