    <edge source="POLYSTYRENE (PS)" target="TENEBRIO OBSCURUS">
      <data key="d3">80.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Tenebrio obscurus can consume and degrade polystyrene (PS), similar to Tenebrio molitor.&lt;SEP&gt;Tenebrio obscurus has been studied for its ability to degrade polystyrene (PS) when compared to bran-fed diets, indicating its potential role in plastic biodegradation.&lt;SEP&gt;Tenebrio obscurus has been studied for its ability to degrade polystyrene (PS) as part of plastic biodegradation research.&lt;SEP&gt;Tenebrio obscurus larvae are also capable of consuming and biodegrading polystyrene (PS) foam, similar to Tenebrio molitor&lt;SEP&gt;Tenebrio obscurus larvae can chew, ingest, and depolymerize polystyrene, demonstrating their potential in plastic biodegradation.&lt;SEP&gt;Tenebrio obscurus larvae consume and degrade polystyrene (PS) more efficiently than Tenebrio molitor, as evidenced by lower THF extractable ratios and greater depolymerization.&lt;SEP&gt;Tenebrio obscurus larvae exhibit similar capabilities to Tenebrio molitor in degrading polystyrene (PS), demonstrating their role in plastic biodegradation.&lt;SEP&gt;Tenebrio obscurus larvae are capable of biodegrading polystyrene, similar to their ability to degrade LDPE.&lt;SEP&gt;Tenebrio obscurus larvae can biodegrade polystyrene (PS) foam through gut microbe-dependent depolymerization, similar to T. molitor.&lt;SEP&gt;Tenebrio obscurus larvae can biodegrade polystyrene foam through gut microbe-dependent depolymerization.</data>
      <data key="d5">7&lt;SEP&gt;8&lt;SEP&gt;9</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-2d5a9fbe4803ded646c6a5e4d23ca93a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-694aaaa7c2839ea048d46b6a2bb13748&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8bb63b06976c3a8e6f2cea85c1ecf518&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7cbedc06292e5cf07fbca1958d8587e6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a54e547b0e77432a65a8a9804c44c5d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-88706f91768bcf0eaa7a49ef2d4b771f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ddf4b13293dd3d8d0887af10fc52c98&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e340b8704554cdc28486ac37e78ab0fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-68c274a59cd5db4cd675bca51f11adb6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d5dc0ba5d8a1abfb746af0dedb7d575b</data>
    </edge>
