    <edge source="POLYSTYRENE (PS)" target="GUT MICROBIOTA">
      <data key="d3">45.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Gut microbiota in mealworms and superworms play a crucial role in the biodegradation of polystyrene (PS).&lt;SEP&gt;The gut microbiota of insects like Tenebrio molitor and Galleria mellonella play a crucial role in the biodegradation of polystyrene (PS).&lt;SEP&gt;The gut microbiota of mealworms plays a crucial role in the degradation of polystyrene (PS), as evidenced by metatranscriptomic analysis.&lt;SEP&gt;The gut microbiota of mealworms plays an essential role in the biodegradation of polystyrene, breaking it down into smaller components.&lt;SEP&gt;Gut microbiota in mealworms play a crucial role in the biodegradation of polystyrene (PS), breaking it down into smaller components.</data>
