    </edge>
    <edge source="POLYSTYRENE (PS)" target="1,3-DI-TERT-BUTYL-2,5-DIMETHYLBENZENE">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">1,3-Di-tert-butyl-2,5-dimethylbenzene is an antioxidant additive found in the frass of PS-fed Tenebrio molitor larvae, indicating the biodegradation of polystyrene.</data>
