      <data key="d4">Gut microbiota contribute to the mineralization of polystyrene into CO2, providing limited energy for the mealworms.&lt;SEP&gt;The gut microbiota of Tenebrio molitor larvae contributes to the mineralization of PET into simpler compounds during biodegradation.</data>
