      <data key="d4">Antibiotic suppression tests demonstrate the essential role of gut microbiota in the biodegradation of polypropylene (PP) by T. molitor and Z. atratus.&lt;SEP&gt;Antibiotic suppression tests demonstrated the dependence of polypropylene depolymerization on gut microbiota in insect larvae.</data>
      <data key="d5">8&lt;SEP&gt;9</data>
