    <edge source="GUT MICROBIOTA" target="SYNERGISTIC EFFECT">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Gut microbiota and digestive enzymes work synergistically in the depolymerization of polyethylene (PE), a process that is depressed under antibiotic conditions.</data>
