    </edge>
    <edge source="EXIGUOBACTERIUM SP. YT2" target="POLYSTYRENE">
      <data key="d3">252.0</data>
      <data key="d4">**Exiguobacterium sp. YT2** is a bacterial strain that has been identified for its ability to degrade **polystyrene**, a common plastic material. This strain was isolated from the guts of mealworms, highlighting its origin and its role as a gut bacterium. **Exiguobacterium sp. YT2** plays a significant role in the biodegradation of polystyrene by converting it into **CO2 and biomass**, with studies showing a weight loss of 28.6% in polystyrene over 30 days. The strain achieves this degradation by forming biofilms and creating cavities on polystyrene films, which underscores its effectiveness in breaking down the plastic. 

The repeated emphasis on its capability to degrade polystyrene highlights its potential in addressing plastic pollution. While some descriptions refer to it as a "gut bacteria," others simply describe it as a bacterial strain, but the core functionality remains consistent: **Exiguobacterium sp. YT2** is a key player in plastic biodegradation, particularly in breaking down polystyrene. This makes it an important subject of study in environmental biotechnology and waste management strategies aimed at mitigating plastic pollution. Its ability to degrade polystyrene not only demonstrates the role of gut bacteria in plastic biodegradation but also offers promising avenues for developing sustainable solutions to plastic waste.</data>
      <data key="d5">8&lt;SEP&gt;9</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-e4443da1fe36ec7133cd5add18d1957a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21bee96879472a1c6df454d862dc9e90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6e5407936cdb4f49bd5363f782dab563&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-35eed7e10fb1cc08baaecab1b1cffad0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03f2fc4d98412efb8a792474cc47e558&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54215690a971d0637c3a6fa61d10f685&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a221e0c62ecd5a2502ec0a4473ab0999&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5e9eb740edf53e540b468122b302cb82&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-20a69982e6abe36c2a0d4a70b78720ec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-85d18d5d86ed1c061dc44d69e9c09ffc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5d6035f4b0686837c8c4319bab80d70&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b27c93b39534612a0492f52ce1f3cd8e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2dafca19c0156f11127587dba3673503&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf54b3c2c01c935a178261a31b8ed897&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03980ce7209ce3f1b1c62c6ed9961e27&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4b74f16813537103549cdcb6770abaea&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d908d878ed4e7fc36f3af71a5be7f2ad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-939f85d52d9301668deab282264e5fd9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b77d05458a2050e3057c427cf81e24ef&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-014a80fd61677e73708fa28913d7fc56&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1684575ed5f73a2ebe1adc7fbbb3b942&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-551c06d3562ff01465354b3a954b1145&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7232abef4870641de7945afeb6a4bf93&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc744f6fa5a9ea876a0423d37eedfc87&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3aaf626f7d7f62d0cee4a0e5efafeb69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9bc3253e8d41785f994d1c6fcc2b6c47&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-07aae06c64778453da4bda48f5347de5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db0003a7244c51697d0129eb84b8e28e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d5261cecf34dd62f3f6ee6f6c3e7834</data>
    </edge>
