    <edge source="POLYPROPYLENE (PP)" target="FOURIER TRANSFORM INFRARED SPECTROSCOPY (FT-IR)">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">FT-IR is used to characterize the functional groups of PP in biodegradation experiments.</data>
