      <data key="d3">16.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Z. atratus larvae are capable of biodegrading polypropylene (PP), as evidenced by changes in chemical structure observed in FTIR and NMR analyses.&lt;SEP&gt;Z. atratus larvae are capable of consuming and biodegrading polypropylene (PP), showing higher consumption rates compared to T. molitor.</data>
