    <edge source="MINERALIZATION" target="MEALWORMS">
      <data key="d3">161.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Mealworms contribute to the mineralization of ingested plastics like PS and PE, converting them into simpler substances.&lt;SEP&gt;Mealworms contribute to the mineralization of plastics into CO2 during the biodegradation process.&lt;SEP&gt;Mealworms contribute to the mineralization of plastics, converting them into CO2 and other inorganic substances&lt;SEP&gt;Mealworms contribute to the mineralization of polystyrene into CO2 during the biodegradation process&lt;SEP&gt;Mealworms contribute to the mineralization of polystyrene into CO2 during the biodegradation process.&lt;SEP&gt;Mealworms contribute to the mineralization of polystyrene into CO2 during the biodegradation process.&lt;SEP&gt;Mealworms contribute to the mineralization of polystyrene into CO2 during the degradation process.&lt;SEP&gt;Mealworms contribute to the mineralization of polystyrene into CO2, facilitated by their gut bacteria.&lt;SEP&gt;Mealworms mineralize polystyrene into CO2, providing a limited energy source for their metabolism.&lt;SEP&gt;Mealworms contribute to the mineralization of polystyrene into CO2 during the degradation process.&lt;SEP&gt;Mealworms facilitate the mineralization of polystyrene into CO2, highlighting their role in plastic degradation.&lt;SEP&gt;Mealworms contribute to the mineralization of polystyrene into CO2, demonstrating their role in biodegradation.&lt;SEP&gt;Mealworms contribute to the mineralization of polystyrene into CO2 during the biodegradation process.&lt;SEP&gt;Mealworms contribute to the mineralization of polystyrene into CO2, demonstrating their role in plastic waste degradation.&lt;SEP&gt;Mealworms contribute to the mineralization of polystyrene into CO2 during the biodegradation process.</data>
      <data key="d5">8&lt;SEP&gt;9</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-81552b76a273b31cc2bd9ed21ed7a919&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d3b3c7bbc61318a9728caff13ac5b04&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-85d18d5d86ed1c061dc44d69e9c09ffc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bfd05eac1abc28ac416e6a56ccd6a9d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8f6621e8191c2fc4d28a63e80e5d467e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-17b1e554820493d86eb8bc96ba8bef37&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-06ba9ca61fb4f42582bbf7bd00ff0005&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b27c93b39534612a0492f52ce1f3cd8e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1769c4becf46c99994cb7ced2bffda1d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-db0003a7244c51697d0129eb84b8e28e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-490fdb90ad8a65d35f3c2cd42a8c4c8e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-05b7bf66b11c66f02e73a07fb823b8fa&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-014a80fd61677e73708fa28913d7fc56&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54215690a971d0637c3a6fa61d10f685&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eed90a978852274ead3771418cd60bed&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-086890e8567c60d8cfa7c03b0cc61f9a</data>
