      <data key="d3">17.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Tenebrio obscurus also contributes to the mineralization of LDPE into CO2.&lt;SEP&gt;Tenebrio obscurus larvae facilitate the mineralization of polystyrene (PS) into inorganic substances like CO2.</data>
