    <edge source="GUT MICROBIAL COMMUNITY" target="MEALWORMS">
      <data key="d3">25.0</data>
      <data key="d4">The gut microbial community of mealworms is essential for the biodegradation of polyether-PU foam, as it aids in breaking down the material.&lt;SEP&gt;The gut microbial community of mealworms shifts in response to polystyrene (PS) consumption, enhancing their ability to degrade plastics.&lt;SEP&gt;The gut microbial community of mealworms is essential for the biodegradation of polystyrene, facilitating metabolic and redox processes.</data>
