      <data key="d3">107.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Gentamicin is used to suppress gut bacteria in mealworms, affecting their nitrogen-fixing capacity and plastic degradation ability.&lt;SEP&gt;Gentamicin suppresses gut bacteria in mealworms, negatively impacting their ability to biodegrade plastics.&lt;SEP&gt;Gentamicin suppresses the gut bacteria of mealworms, inhibiting their ability to degrade polystyrene.&lt;SEP&gt;Gentamicin suppresses the gut bacteria of mealworms, negatively impacting their ability to degrade polystyrene.&lt;SEP&gt;Gentamicin suppresses the gut bacteria of mealworms, significantly reducing their ability to degrade polystyrene.&lt;SEP&gt;Gentamicin suppresses the gut bacteria of mealworms, negatively impacting their ability to degrade polystyrene.&lt;SEP&gt;Gentamicin suppresses gut microorganisms in mealworms, impairing their ability to biodegrade polystyrene (PS).&lt;SEP&gt;Gentamicin suppresses the gut bacteria of mealworms, negatively impacting their ability to degrade Styrofoam.&lt;SEP&gt;Gentamicin suppresses the gut bacteria of mealworms, negatively impacting their ability to degrade polystyrene.&lt;SEP&gt;Gentamicin suppresses the gut bacteria of mealworms, reducing their ability to degrade polystyrene&lt;SEP&gt;Gentamicin suppresses gut bacteria in mealworms, reducing their ability to degrade polystyrene.&lt;SEP&gt;Gentamicin suppresses the gut bacteria of mealworms, inhibiting their ability to degrade polystyrene&lt;SEP&gt;Gentamicin suppresses the gut bacteria of mealworms, reducing their nitrogen-fixing activity and ability to degrade Styrofoam.&lt;SEP&gt;Gentamicin suppresses the gut bacteria of mealworms, negatively impacting their ability to degrade polystyrene.&lt;SEP&gt;Gentamicin suppresses the gut bacteria of mealworms, reducing their ability to degrade polystyrene.</data>
      <data key="d5">7&lt;SEP&gt;8</data>
