      <data key="d3">16.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Transcriptome analysis is used to study the molecular mechanisms of plastic degradation by mealworms.&lt;SEP&gt;Transcriptome analysis of gut bacteria in mealworms has been conducted to understand their role in plastic degradation.</data>
      <data key="d5">7&lt;SEP&gt;9</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-718900b924b6910a58e8ead81c01c723&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-af801199dfd68205bddcbe0bcda26eef</data>
    </edge>
