      <data key="d3">21.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Starvation control is used to compare the effects of microplastics (MPS) and bran on mealworm survival and growth.&lt;SEP&gt;Starvation control is used to compare the effects of plastic diets on mealworms.&lt;SEP&gt;Starvation control serves as a baseline to compare the effects of plastic and bran diets on mealworm mortality and weight.</data>
      <data key="d5">7</data>
