      <data key="d4">Fatty acid degradation pathways were significantly enriched in mealworms fed on EPS and LDPE, indicating their role in plastic breakdown.&lt;SEP&gt;Mealworms exhibit changes in fatty acid degradation pathways when fed plastics like EPS and LDPE, indicating metabolic adaptation.</data>
      <data key="d5">7&lt;SEP&gt;8</data>
