      <data key="d3">16.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Mealworms are fed plastic, such as polystyrene, to study their biodegradation capabilities and life cycle completion.&lt;SEP&gt;Mealworms fed on plastics showed faster pupation but failed to grow, indicating the lack of nutritional value in plastics.</data>
      <data key="d5">8</data>
