    <edge source="MEALWORMS" target="GUT MICROBES">
      <data key="d3">54.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Gut microbes in mealworms are essential for the biodegradation of plastics, facilitating the depolymerization process.&lt;SEP&gt;Gut microbes in mealworms are essential for the biodegradation of polystyrene, contributing to its depolymerization and mineralization.&lt;SEP&gt;The gut microbes of mealworms are essential for the biodegradation of polystyrene, as they facilitate the breakdown of the plastic.&lt;SEP&gt;The gut microbes of mealworms are essential for the biodegradation of plastics like polystyrene.&lt;SEP&gt;Gut microbes in mealworms play a synergistic role in the biodegradation of plastics, enhancing enzymatic and microbial reactions.</data>
      <data key="d5">9</data>
