      <data key="d4">Mealworms are being explored as an alternative protein source for livestock feed and human consumption.&lt;SEP&gt;Mealworms are considered an alternative protein source due to their high protein content and ability to biodegrade plastics.&lt;SEP&gt;Mealworms are considered an alternative protein source due to their high protein content and ability to biodegrade plastics.&lt;SEP&gt;Mealworms are considered an alternative protein source for livestock feed, especially when combined with biodegradation techniques.</data>
