      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Delayed pupation in mealworms allows for greater consumption of polystyrene (PS), aiding in biodegradation.</data>
      <data key="d5">7</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-44565f26e7290c5eb0f26935608a5f16</data>
    </edge>
