      <data key="d3">17.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Mealworms are capable of degrading plastic, such as Styrofoam, through the activity of their gut microbiota.&lt;SEP&gt;Mealworms play a significant role in the degradation of various plastics, contributing to environmental waste reduction.</data>
      <data key="d5">8&lt;SEP&gt;9</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-fa10245aaff722ac7d69e73bed8afe74&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-918d0788c95399a6714bd40c688594de</data>
    </edge>
