    <edge source="RESEARCH STUDY" target="TENEBRIO MOLITOR (TM)">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">This research study focuses on the role of Tenebrio molitor larvae in the biodegradation of plastics like polystyrene (PS) and polyethylene (PE).</data>
