    <edge source="POLYSTYRENE" target="PLASTIC WASTE POLLUTION">
      <data key="d3">26.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Polystyrene is a major contributor to plastic waste pollution due to its non-biodegradable nature.&lt;SEP&gt;Polystyrene is a major contributor to plastic waste pollution due to its widespread use and resistance to degradation.</data>
