    <edge source="POLYSTYRENE" target="LIPID BIOMASS">
      <data key="d3">14.0</data>
      <data key="d4">A small fraction of ingested polystyrene is incorporated into lipid biomass during biodegradation.&lt;SEP&gt;Lipid biomass is a byproduct of the biodegradation of polystyrene by mealworms, indicating the incorporation of plastic-derived carbon into biological material.</data>
      <data key="d5">7</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-f45bee9c7111e3b95e966d23c3a6223d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-03980ce7209ce3f1b1c62c6ed9961e27</data>
