      <data key="d3">22.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Pseudomonas aeruginosa DSM 50071 degrades polystyrene, as demonstrated by molecular analysis.&lt;SEP&gt;Pseudomonas aeruginosa DSM 50071 is involved in the decomposition of polystyrene, contributing to its biodegradation.&lt;SEP&gt;Pseudomonas aeruginosa DSM 50071 is studied for its role in PS film biodegradation, contributing to environmental remediation.</data>
      <data key="d5">7&lt;SEP&gt;8</data>
