      <data key="d5">8</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-aa3bd7c611ad935dba56fd3d7300cbc3</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="POLYSTYRENE" target="COMMERCIAL PS FOAMS">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Commercial PS foams, such as expanded polystyrene (EPS), are a common form of polystyrene that mealworms can biodegrade.</data>
      <data key="d5">7</data>
