      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Polystyrene is the base material from which polystyrene microplastics are derived, making it a key component in the study of biodegradation.</data>
      <data key="d5">9</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-e136b8a35c0d60811b9daf0cbd5729f5</data>
