    <edge source="TOXICOLOGICAL ASSESSMENT" target="MICROPLASTICS">
      <data key="d3">135.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Microplastics are evaluated for their toxicological effects on organisms and ecosystems&lt;SEP&gt;Microplastics are subject to toxicological assessment to understand their impact on organisms and ecosystems&lt;SEP&gt;Toxicological assessment is necessary to understand the health and environmental impacts of microplastics derived from polystyrene.&lt;SEP&gt;Microplastics are subject to toxicological assessment to determine their impact on organisms and ecosystems.&lt;SEP&gt;Toxicological assessment is crucial for understanding the harmful effects of microplastics on organisms and ecosystems.&lt;SEP&gt;Microplastics are subject to toxicological assessment due to their potential to interact with the endocrine systems of animals and cause adverse health effects.&lt;SEP&gt;Microplastics are studied for their toxicological effects on aquatic environments and microbial decomposers.&lt;SEP&gt;Microplastics are studied in toxicological assessments to understand their effects on ecosystems and human health.&lt;SEP&gt;Toxicological assessments are conducted to evaluate the effects of microplastics on organisms and ecosystems.&lt;SEP&gt;Microplastics are subject to toxicological assessment to evaluate their impact on organisms and ecosystems.&lt;SEP&gt;Microplastics are subject to toxicological assessment to understand their environmental and health impacts.&lt;SEP&gt;Microplastics are subject to toxicological assessment to evaluate their impact on organisms and ecosystems.&lt;SEP&gt;Microplastics are subject to toxicological assessment to determine their impact on organisms and ecosystems.&lt;SEP&gt;Toxicological assessments are conducted to evaluate the impact of microplastics on organisms and ecosystems.&lt;SEP&gt;Microplastics pose risks to human health through ingestion and inhalation, necessitating toxicological assessment to evaluate their impacts.&lt;SEP&gt;Toxicological assessments are conducted to evaluate the impact of microplastics on organisms, including their growth and metabolic responses.</data>
      <data key="d5">7&lt;SEP&gt;8&lt;SEP&gt;9</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-c1d76ad321e1c68d5f139cdb94d5bf42&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59defb995f5b0409c31d1922916c2f22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4c7bcc9530f9dc72038f774f6f084ab6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aa3bd7c611ad935dba56fd3d7300cbc3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-82390f5824b5ef543e1f258b1a47e167&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-825c2784fa66ce67114e4173ed0702f9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce7cf71b094ef4329d3da3b628438bec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0f2fd4b2e978e6745e0dde602114a826&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-87427955fe47fc204be31f4d99036055&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fe381daaa91bbff20758798e5baf82b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a53d37e7ff6850fc55177f325e49861&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aface14c9ee7dd5ccd25e7094ed5c1c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54215690a971d0637c3a6fa61d10f685&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1684575ed5f73a2ebe1adc7fbbb3b942&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fcc545cfe4d6e8e04c3698a149d4101a</data>
    </edge>
