    <edge source="TOXICOLOGICAL ASSESSMENT" target="PLASTICS">
      <data key="d3">28.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Toxicological assessment is crucial for understanding the environmental and health impacts of plastic biodegradation by organisms like Tenebrio molitor.&lt;SEP&gt;Toxicological assessments evaluate the safety of plastics and their degradation products on organisms and ecosystems.&lt;SEP&gt;Toxicological assessments are conducted to evaluate the effects of plastics on organisms and ecosystems.&lt;SEP&gt;Toxicological assessments are conducted to evaluate the effects of plastics on organisms and ecosystems.</data>
      <data key="d5">7</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-bdf2753a9a78b282c1ca2c0539e3203d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5d6035f4b0686837c8c4319bab80d70&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2741fab96df80d452d2d4cc651730521</data>
    </edge>
