      <data key="d3">30.0</data>
      <data key="d4">A toxicological assessment is conducted to evaluate the effects of plastic consumption on the health and growth of yellow mealworms&lt;SEP&gt;The growth and development of yellow mealworm larvae are assessed to determine the effects of plastic degradation&lt;SEP&gt;Toxicological assessment is implied to evaluate the safety and effects of plastic degradation by yellow mealworms on their growth and development.&lt;SEP&gt;Toxicological assessments are conducted to evaluate the effects of plastic biodegradation by yellow mealworms on ecosystems and organisms.</data>
