    </edge>
    <edge source="TOXICOLOGICAL ASSESSMENT" target="NANOPLASTICS (NPS)">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Nanoplastics (NPs) were not detected in this study, reducing the risk of toxicity compared to previous observations in non-plastic-degrading macroinvertebrates.</data>
      <data key="d5">7</data>
