      <data key="d3">15.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Toxicological assessments are essential to understand the health and environmental impacts of plastic degradation products.&lt;SEP&gt;Toxicological assessments evaluate the safety and environmental impact of plastic waste and its degradation products on organisms and ecosystems.</data>
