    <edge source="GEL PERMEATION CHROMATOGRAPHY" target="POLYPROPYLENE">
      <data key="d3">24.0</data>
      <data key="d4">GPC is used to determine the molecular weight distribution of polypropylene, aiding in the study of its degradation.&lt;SEP&gt;GPC is used to measure the molecular weight changes in polypropylene materials after degradation by yellow mealworms.&lt;SEP&gt;Gel permeation chromatography is used to analyze molecular weight changes in polypropylene after biodegradation by larvae.</data>
