      <data key="d3">17.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Superworms (Zophobas aratus) can biodegrade polypropylene through gut-microbe-dependent depolymerization.&lt;SEP&gt;Zophobas atratus larvae have been shown to biodegrade polypropylene, demonstrating their potential in plastic waste management.</data>
      <data key="d5">8&lt;SEP&gt;9</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-6f830cfd93570c7a9762518aa356ab69&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3569d74f8a4c9d0851777a5a66284a00</data>
    </edge>
