    <edge source="TENEBRIO OBSCURUS" target="LLDPE">
      <data key="d3">90.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Tenebrio obscurus consumes LLDPE, influencing its gut microbial community and aiding in the biodegradation of the polymer.&lt;SEP&gt;Tenebrio obscurus is studied for its ability to degrade linear low-density polyethylene (LLDPE) through its gut microbiome.&lt;SEP&gt;Tenebrio obscurus larvae are used to biodegrade linear low-density polyethylene (LLDPE) microplastics, contributing to plastic waste reduction.&lt;SEP&gt;Tenebrio obscurus larvae biodegrade LLDPE, causing oxidative stress and ecotoxicity.&lt;SEP&gt;Tenebrio obscurus larvae can also biodegrade LLDPE, with specific consumption rates and residual PE percentages measured.&lt;SEP&gt;Tenebrio obscurus larvae can biodegrade LLDPE, though at a slower rate compared to LDPE.&lt;SEP&gt;Tenebrio obscurus larvae can biodegrade LLDPE, with changes in gut microbial community structure observed.&lt;SEP&gt;Tenebrio obscurus larvae can degrade LLDPE, contributing to the reduction of environmental pollution.&lt;SEP&gt;Tenebrio obscurus larvae also depolymerize and biodegrade LLDPE, showing similar patterns of molecular weight changes as T. molitor.&lt;SEP&gt;Tenebrio obscurus larvae biodegrade LLDPE, showing limited extent depolymerization, similar to Tenebrio molitor&lt;SEP&gt;Tenebrio obscurus larvae can ingest and biodegrade LLDPE, though the extent of depolymerization is less than that of LDPE.&lt;SEP&gt;Tenebrio obscurus larvae were studied for their ability to degrade linear low-density polyethylene (LLDPE)</data>
      <data key="d5">7&lt;SEP&gt;8</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-aa33fb34ba06610c290cdfd8a5b4e916&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b21eb0db725b38c3e0b5c01526ce90b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd4d84d6de496440fcabc6616d1c96ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-90367ecb21e0f14b2e548acf307a2628&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-98d4ea946a931acf7e5a8292c30ea4c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d8c6850a83a1c6efd4f1a3a37a0a8181&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2e1faf524e6fabeb512a07b13f37e51e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd73d3cca5434181ee9dd1ad1b8f8ab9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc908e62eec4d1d05265c6e451cca84c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f23046f647dab4d4caebd663db9aecde&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f75b58db5211fc7348ccca8206b9bbae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d3380732c060363504db5f6e4b8610b7</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="TENEBRIO OBSCURUS" target="HDPE">
      <data key="d3">93.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Tenebrio obscurus consumes HDPE, affecting its gut microbial diversity and contributing to the biodegradation process.&lt;SEP&gt;Tenebrio obscurus larvae are involved in the biodegradation of HDPE, with specific consumption rates and residual PE percentages observed.&lt;SEP&gt;Tenebrio obscurus larvae are used to biodegrade high-density polyethylene (HDPE) microplastics, contributing to plastic waste reduction.&lt;SEP&gt;Tenebrio obscurus larvae biodegrade HDPE, inducing oxidative stress and physiological responses.&lt;SEP&gt;Tenebrio obscurus larvae can biodegrade HDPE, but the rate of degradation is slower compared to LDPE and LLDPE.&lt;SEP&gt;Tenebrio obscurus larvae can biodegrade HDPE, with the gut microbiome playing a key role in the degradation process.&lt;SEP&gt;Tenebrio obscurus larvae can consume HDPE, resulting in distinct gut microbiome changes compared to control diets.&lt;SEP&gt;Tenebrio obscurus larvae can degrade HDPE, contributing to the reduction of environmental pollution.&lt;SEP&gt;Tenebrio obscurus has shown some ability to biodegrade high-density polyethylene (HDPE), though the process is less efficient than with LDPE.&lt;SEP&gt;Tenebrio obscurus larvae also depolymerize HDPE, showing limited extent depolymerization similar to T. molitor.&lt;SEP&gt;Tenebrio obscurus larvae biodegrade HDPE, but its high crystallinity and stability result in limited depolymerization&lt;SEP&gt;Tenebrio obscurus larvae can ingest and biodegrade HDPE, though it is more resistant to depolymerization compared to LDPE and LLDPE.&lt;SEP&gt;Tenebrio obscurus larvae exhibit similar biodegradation capabilities for HDPE microplastics as Tenebrio molitor</data>
      <data key="d5">6&lt;SEP&gt;7&lt;SEP&gt;8</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-aa33fb34ba06610c290cdfd8a5b4e916&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b21eb0db725b38c3e0b5c01526ce90b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd4d84d6de496440fcabc6616d1c96ff&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-90367ecb21e0f14b2e548acf307a2628&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-98d4ea946a931acf7e5a8292c30ea4c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d8c6850a83a1c6efd4f1a3a37a0a8181&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bd73d3cca5434181ee9dd1ad1b8f8ab9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cc908e62eec4d1d05265c6e451cca84c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-109486cd939a227e73354d0478c59ecf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-26a193cc62c03cb6460b0434df42d8c8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f23046f647dab4d4caebd663db9aecde&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f75b58db5211fc7348ccca8206b9bbae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ac1b1db6ffab6f4cfea7a525785a2fc</data>
    </edge>
