      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Py-GCMS is used to detect and analyze microplastics (MPs) and nanoplastics (NPs) in frass.</data>
      <data key="d5">7</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-84a8f1c256b1141b6bd2b404e817dfb7</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MICROPLASTICS" target="POLYETHYLENE TEREPHTHALATE">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Polyethylene terephthalate (PET) is found as microplastics (MPs) in animal-based traditional medicinal materials.</data>
