      <data key="d3">16.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Pyrolysis is a method to mitigate microplastics in sewage sludge by breaking them down&lt;SEP&gt;Pyrolysis is used to mitigate microplastics in sewage sludge, reducing their environmental impact.</data>
