      <data key="d3">14.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Plant species interact with microplastics and nanoplastics, providing insights into the spread and effects of plastic pollution in terrestrial ecosystems.&lt;SEP&gt;Plant species interact with microplastics, which can affect their growth and health.</data>
