      <data key="d3">17.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Mealworm larvae are being explored as an alternative protein source for livestock feed and human consumption.&lt;SEP&gt;Mealworm larvae are studied not only for their biodegradation abilities but also as a potential alternative protein source for human consumption</data>
