    </edge>
    <edge source="MEALWORM LARVAE" target="EXPERIMENTAL PROCEDURE">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">The experimental procedure involves studying the biodegradation of plastics by mealworm larvae, highlighting their role in plastic degradation.</data>
      <data key="d5">8</data>
