    </edge>
    <edge source="MEALWORM LARVAE" target="DIET 1">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Diet 1, with low PS:bran, shows comparable PS consumption rates to Diet 2 by the end of the experiment.</data>
      <data key="d5">7</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-7c810740a381d4d9e829e28c01e62564</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MEALWORM LARVAE" target="DIET 3">
      <data key="d3">6.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Diet 3, with PS/barley 20:1, requires less handling but shows lower PS degradation rates compared to other diets.</data>
      <data key="d5">6</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-7c810740a381d4d9e829e28c01e62564</data>
    </edge>
