      <data key="d4">Diet 3 requires less handling but shows lower PS degradation rates compared to other diets.</data>
      <data key="d5">6</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-7c810740a381d4d9e829e28c01e62564</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="MEALWORM LARVAE" target="POLYSTYRENE (PS) DEGRADATION">
      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Mealworm larvae play a key role in the biodegradation of polystyrene (PS), breaking it down into smaller components.</data>
      <data key="d5">9</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-7c810740a381d4d9e829e28c01e62564</data>
