    <edge source="MEALWORM LARVAE" target="POLYSTYRENE FOAM">
      <data key="d3">16.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Mealworm larvae can be fed polystyrene foam, which affects their fatty acid composition and demonstrates their potential role in biodegradation.&lt;SEP&gt;Mealworm larvae can consume and degrade polystyrene foam, demonstrating their potential in reducing plastic waste.</data>
      <data key="d5">7&lt;SEP&gt;9</data>
