    <edge source="PLASTIC WASTE" target="ENVIRONMENTAL POLLUTION">
      <data key="d3">141.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Environmental pollution caused by plastic waste is a global issue, and biodegradation by mealworms and superworms offers a potential solution.&lt;SEP&gt;Plastic waste contributes to environmental pollution, which can be mitigated through biodegradation processes by organisms like superworms and mealworms.&lt;SEP&gt;Plastic waste is a major contributor to environmental pollution, with synthetic polymers like polyethylene and polystyrene being persistent pollutants.&lt;SEP&gt;Plastic waste is a major contributor to environmental pollution.&lt;SEP&gt;Plastic waste, including polystyrene, accumulates in the environment and poses ecological threats&lt;SEP&gt;Plastic waste is a major contributor to environmental pollution, which mealworms can help mitigate through biodegradation.&lt;SEP&gt;Plastic waste contributes to environmental pollution, with its growth exceeding current mitigation efforts.&lt;SEP&gt;Plastic waste is a major contributor to environmental pollution, affecting ecosystems and organisms.&lt;SEP&gt;Plastic waste contributes significantly to environmental pollution, particularly in marine ecosystems.&lt;SEP&gt;Plastic waste contributes to environmental pollution, posing risks to ecosystems and human health.&lt;SEP&gt;Plastic waste is a major contributor to environmental pollution, particularly in marine ecosystems.&lt;SEP&gt;Plastic waste, including polystyrene, is a major contributor to environmental pollution.&lt;SEP&gt;Plastic waste, including polystyrene, contributes to environmental pollution and health risks.&lt;SEP&gt;Plastic waste contributes to environmental pollution, with insects offering potential solutions for biodegradation.&lt;SEP&gt;Plastic waste contributes significantly to environmental pollution, posing challenges for ecosystems and waste management.&lt;SEP&gt;Plastic waste is a major contributor to environmental pollution, harming ecosystems and organisms.</data>
      <data key="d5">8&lt;SEP&gt;9</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-9bd2f7b94f62fa18de9e02426577d241&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3667703f7416ebab666e65b375dd8582&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ee089593160e720e507848fa8c917a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f45bee9c7111e3b95e966d23c3a6223d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56604c68c2f6221f63a4afa5d457e8ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-df4c8c66bfbbfc37ed842f53d2b8796c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21bee96879472a1c6df454d862dc9e90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2dafca19c0156f11127587dba3673503&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ffec9fc63ae323ee0c22c612bb89755&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9bc3253e8d41785f994d1c6fcc2b6c47&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-38283df790b03806f99ca90272a1000f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-678bd592bfdda3f6dd8f2a6659de7fde&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9a31a12c930b59b872c94dda484d0db4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e4da90774e2e5cb1fea30fd5aa390760&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eada60ee606520104bb515c4896d6b0b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-196a7570e6cac531e94c1680c54f5491</data>
    </edge>
