      <data key="d4">Darkling beetles, including Tenebrio obscurus, are often studied in ecological research due to their adaptability and environmental roles.</data>
      <data key="d5">8</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-0c7b499dc783c21f764eb35989a449f3</data>
