      <data key="d3">16.0</data>
      <data key="d4">High-temperature gel permeation chromatography (HT-GPC) is used to analyze the molecular weight and distribution of LDPE at elevated temperatures.&lt;SEP&gt;High-temperature gel permeation chromatography is used to analyze the molecular weights of low-density polyethylene polymers extracted from the frass of Tenebrio molitor larvae.</data>
