      <data key="d3">16.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Zalerion maritimum can biodegrade polyethylene microplastics, contributing to the reduction of marine plastic pollution.&lt;SEP&gt;Zalerion maritimum, a marine fungus, can biodegrade polyethylene microplastics, aiding in environmental cleanup.</data>
      <data key="d5">8</data>
