    <edge source="WHEAT BRAN" target="YELLOW MEALWORM">
      <data key="d3">21.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Wheat bran is used as a control diet for yellow mealworms to compare the effects of plastic diets on their gut microbiome.&lt;SEP&gt;Wheat bran is used as a feed component for yellow mealworms, providing a controlled environment for plastic degradation experiments.&lt;SEP&gt;Wheat bran is used as a standard culture substrate to feed yellow mealworms in the study, ensuring their health and growth</data>
