    <edge source="ENZYMES" target="PET">
      <data key="d3">25.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Enzymes produced by the gut microbiota of Tenebrio molitor larvae are essential for the degradation of PET.&lt;SEP&gt;Enzymes secreted by Tenebrio molitor larvae play a key role in the biodegradation of PET, independent of gut microbes.&lt;SEP&gt;Enzymes secreted by Tenebrio molitor larvae play a key role in the biodegradation of PET, independent of gut microbes.</data>
      <data key="d5">8&lt;SEP&gt;9</data>
