    <edge source="EISENIA FETIDA" target="MICROPLASTICS (MPS)">
      <data key="d3">16.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Eisenia fetida can ingest and biofragment microplastics, producing nanoplastics that damage spermatogenesis and coelomocyte viability.&lt;SEP&gt;Eisenia fetida exhibits increased reactive oxygen species (ROS) levels when exposed to microplastics, indicating oxidative stress.</data>
      <data key="d5">8</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-e98fb757cb68ae45626058d9c3a15cb4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-44bfda02e6c219cb097ec88543433798</data>
