    <edge source="ALTERNATIVE PROTEIN SOURCE" target="FOOD SAFETY">
      <data key="d3">40.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Food safety is a concern when using organisms like mealworms as alternative protein sources, especially when they are exposed to plastics.&lt;SEP&gt;Food safety regulations ensure that alternative protein sources, such as mealworms, are safe for consumption and meet nutritional standards.&lt;SEP&gt;Food safety measures are essential when exploring alternative protein sources like edible insects for human and animal consumption.&lt;SEP&gt;Food safety measures are essential when exploring alternative protein sources like edible insects for human and animal consumption.&lt;SEP&gt;Food safety is a critical consideration when evaluating alternative protein sources, such as edible insects, for human and livestock consumption.</data>
