      <data key="d4">Mealworm larvae are considered an alternative protein source due to their ability to metabolize plastic substrates.&lt;SEP&gt;Mealworms are considered an alternative protein source, especially when bred on synthetic polymer diets, despite challenges in fatty acid synthesis</data>
