      <data key="d4">Mealworm larvae demonstrate increased metabolic activity when exposed to polylactic acid, indicating a positive interaction.&lt;SEP&gt;Mealworm larvae show increased metabolic activity when exposed to PLA, suggesting a positive interaction with this biodegradable plastic.</data>
