      <data key="d3">15.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Superworms consume polyurethane foam, showing a similar ingestion preference to yellow mealworms.&lt;SEP&gt;Superworms have been shown to degrade polyurethane foam, with their gut microbes facilitating the biodegradation.</data>
