    <edge source="GUT MICROBES" target="ANTIBIOTIC SUPPRESSION">
      <data key="d3">21.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Antibiotic suppression inhibits the activity of gut microbes, which affects the biodegradation of certain plastics like PS and PVC.&lt;SEP&gt;Antibiotic suppression reduces gut microbes in larvae, helping to determine the role of gut microbes in the biodegradation of low-density polyethylene (LDPE).</data>
