    </edge>
    <edge source="GUT MICROBES" target="PET">
      <data key="d3">52.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Gut microbes in Tenebrio molitor are essential for the degradation of PET, showing chemotaxis towards PET metabolic intermediates.&lt;SEP&gt;Gut microbes in Tenebrio molitor are essential for the degradation of PET, showing chemotaxis towards PET metabolic intermediates.&lt;SEP&gt;Gut microbes in Tenebrio molitor larvae contribute to the biodegradation of PET, breaking it down into smaller molecules.&lt;SEP&gt;Gut microbes in Tenebrio molitor larvae play a significant role in PET biodegradation, as shown by transcriptome and metabolome analyses&lt;SEP&gt;Gut microbes in Tenebrio molitor larvae contribute to the biodegradation of PET, breaking it down into smaller molecules.&lt;SEP&gt;Gut microbes in Tenebrio molitor larvae play a significant role in PET biodegradation, as shown by transcriptome and metabolome analyses</data>
      <data key="d5">8&lt;SEP&gt;9</data>
