    <edge source="LARVAE" target="PLA">
      <data key="d3">15.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Larvae are capable of biodegrading PLA, with higher removal efficiencies observed when fed PLA compared to other plastics.&lt;SEP&gt;Larvae were fed with PLA to evaluate its impact on ROS levels, showing similar ROS levels to those fed with bran only.</data>
