      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Acetylene reduction assays are used to measure the nitrogen-fixing activity of mealworms, demonstrating their ability to fix atmospheric nitrogen.</data>
      <data key="d5">8</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-813b71242f366f10218c10631cd7dee8</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NITROGEN FIXATION" target="NITROGEN ISOTOPIC ANALYSIS">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Nitrogen isotopic analysis provides evidence for the assimilation of fixed nitrogen by mealworms, confirming their ability to overcome nitrogen limitation.</data>
      <data key="d5">8</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-813b71242f366f10218c10631cd7dee8</data>
    </edge>
