      <data key="d3">17.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Styrene is the main thermal decomposition product of Styrofoam, detected during TG-FTIR analysis.&lt;SEP&gt;Styrene is the main thermal decomposition product of Styrofoam, detected during its thermal degradation.</data>
