      <data key="d3">48.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Carboxylesterase is highly active in degrading PET oligomers, contributing to the breakdown of PET polymers.&lt;SEP&gt;Carboxylesterase is highly active in degrading PET oligomers, contributing to the breakdown of PET polymers.&lt;SEP&gt;Carboxylesterase is highly active toward PET oligomers, contributing to the breakdown of PET.&lt;SEP&gt;Carboxylesterase is overexpressed in Tenebrio molitor larvae and facilitates the surface modification of PET during biodegradation&lt;SEP&gt;Carboxylesterase is highly active toward PET oligomers, contributing to the breakdown of PET.&lt;SEP&gt;Carboxylesterase is overexpressed in Tenebrio molitor larvae and facilitates the surface modification of PET during biodegradation</data>
