    </edge>
    <edge source="EXPANDED POLYSTYRENE (EPS)" target="BEETLES">
      <data key="d3">11.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Beetles primarily consume the hard outer layer of EPS cups, with minimal contribution to EPS degradation&lt;SEP&gt;Beetles, in co-culture with mealworms, contribute to the consumption of expanded polystyrene (EPS).</data>
      <data key="d5">5&lt;SEP&gt;6</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-c11c77665793ac79aecfb19a89dd1f52&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b33a3915745323f1bd29bd2febf60b8</data>
