      <data key="d3">16.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Tenebrio larvae can degrade LLDPE, with their gut microbiota enhancing carbon and nitrogen metabolism to facilitate this process.&lt;SEP&gt;Tenebrio larvae show significant physiological and metabolic impairments when exposed to LLDPE, a poorly degradable plastic polymer.</data>
      <data key="d5">8</data>
