    <edge source="LLDPE" target="T. MOLITOR">
      <data key="d3">16.0</data>
      <data key="d4">T. molitor larvae can biodegrade LLDPE microplastics, as evidenced by changes in molecular weight and FTIR spectra.&lt;SEP&gt;T. molitor larvae can biodegrade LLDPE, a type of polyethylene microplastic, through their gut microbiota.</data>
      <data key="d5">8</data>
