      <data key="d3">28.0</data>
      <data key="d4">X-ray diffraction analysis measures the crystallinity degree of PET polymers, which influences their biodegradability by Tenebrio molitor larvae.&lt;SEP&gt;X-ray diffraction analysis measures the crystallinity degree of PET polymers, which influences their biodegradability by Tenebrio molitor larvae.&lt;SEP&gt;X-ray diffraction is used to assess the crystallinity of PET polymers after biodegradation by larvae.&lt;SEP&gt;X-ray diffraction is used to assess the crystallinity of PET polymers after biodegradation by larvae.</data>
