      <data key="d3">26.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Cement mortar is used to attach EPS to ceramic bricks, creating a model for multilayer wall structures.&lt;SEP&gt;Cement mortar was used to bond EPS to ceramic bricks, which was later removed by Tenebrio molitor larvae.&lt;SEP&gt;EPS is bonded to cement mortar in the study, which is later removed by Tenebrio molitor larvae.</data>
