      <data key="d3">16.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Azotobacter beijerinckii HM121 produces Hydroquinone Peroxidase, an enzyme capable of degrading polystyrene.&lt;SEP&gt;Hydroquinone peroxidase is produced by Azotobacter beijerinckii HM121 and is involved in the degradation of polystyrene.</data>
      <data key="d5">8</data>
