    </edge>
    <edge source="SUPERNATANT FRACTIONS" target="EMULSIFICATION">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Supernatant fractions, particularly the 30-100 kDa fraction, exhibit emulsifying properties that enhance the biodegradation of polystyrene.</data>
      <data key="d5">8</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-902ed6a67c601276c5dbf43c35dd824f</data>
    </edge>
