    <edge source="HYDROCARBON-DEGRADING MICROBES" target="USED ENGINE OIL">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Hydrocarbon-degrading microbes can biodegrade used engine oil, aiding in the remediation of oil-contaminated soils.</data>
