      <data key="d4">HT-GPC is used to perform molecular weight analysis of PE mulching films after bacterial treatment.</data>
      <data key="d5">8</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-af682f78e3e8970d7d70b027a8f79116</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="HT-GPC" target="RESIDUAL POLYMERS">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">HT-GPC is used to analyze the molecular weight changes in residual polymers from mealworm frass, indicating the extent of plastic degradation.</data>
      <data key="d5">8</data>
