      <data key="d6">chunk-463ac9dfa68274d35700c61208f4ea85</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="GREATER WAX MOTH" target="BOMBELLI ET AL.">
      <data key="d3">7.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Bombelli et al. studied the biodegradation of polyethylene by greater wax moth larvae, though their results were later questioned.</data>
