      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Alkyl hydroperoxide reductase C (ahpC) is a degradative enzyme identified in Enterobacter hormaechei LG3, contributing to polystyrene biodegradation.</data>
      <data key="d5">8</data>
