      <data key="d3">9.0</data>
      <data key="d4">PCR mixtures are used to amplify the nitrogenase (nifH) gene from nitrogen-fixing bacteria.</data>
      <data key="d5">9</data>
      <data key="d6">chunk-e37da2fbe64f85c50c36da45006f4c23</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="NITROGEN (N&lt;SUB&gt;2&lt;/SUB&gt;)" target="CARBOSIEVE G COLUMN">
      <data key="d3">8.0</data>
      <data key="d4">Nitrogen (N&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;) is separated using a Carbosieve G column for isotopic analysis.</data>
